 アンマウント時にも原点へ戻す\n- 同一ID掛け直し時は rest pose(xrift:vehicle-pose) も原点で上書き（初回マウントの駐車位置復元は維持）","tree":{"sha":"f8023764b821eb8e8c425d80009ea5b02555ad92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-item-super-cub/git/trees/f8023764b821eb8e8c425d80009ea5b02555ad92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sawa-zen/xrift-item-super-cub/git/commits/c80ee6c109f3c4e136e185cfeb138f87a1365054","verification":{"payload":"tree f8023764b821eb8e8c425d80009ea5b02555ad92\nparent 53e348582f721d6febda929263e5cad8f9ab4ef5\nauthor sawa-zen <sawadasuiren@gmail.com> 1789550325 +0900\ncommitter sawa-zen <sawadasuiren@gmail.com> 1789550325 +0900\n\n引っ込め→再表示でカブが原点に戻るよう位置リセットを強化\n\n- マウント時の1発リセットでは ref 未確定や同期姿勢の lerp に負けるため再試行＋短時間吸着に\n- アンマウント時にも原点へ戻す\n- 同一ID掛け直し時は rest pose(xrift:vehicle-pose) も原点で上書き（初回マウントの駐車位置復元は維持）\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQKVTm3Q7nPPZqH7kSujh8MBTKX\nj5yl3j8MmaSRg8tpwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQFAuCN/JjHl+swoCyt7PlVQKK/a4R9+7fAF33zJF8YdDR7efAopdtSg58xSediwM5s\nlwvpA2AGVoERf4lQDdPgE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T09:18:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3971271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sawa-zen","id":3971271,"login":"sawa-zen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NzEyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sawa-zen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https: