rAreiza"},"message":"fix(federation): expose remotes.shell so shell/apiClient and shell/session resolve\n\nlms-front''s federation({ exposes }) already publishes apiClient/session, but\nthis portal (and the other two) never declared remotes: { shell }, so the\nbare ''shell/apiClient'' import couldn''t resolve at all — Vite''s import-analysis\nplugin failed with \"Failed to resolve import ''shell/apiClient''\". type:\n''module'' matters too: the shorthand string form defaults to type: ''var'' (a\nglobal-variable container), but @module-federation/vite''s remoteEntry.js is\nan ES module — a ''var''-typed load can''t read exports off it (RUNTIME-001).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b110002e42f76b3eb798780dcabbaf59ab7d01df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/git/trees/b110002e42f76b3eb798780dcabbaf59ab7d01df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/git/commits/965f63c814e45bd161a2ca4f26651bcbe8c167c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143123076?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OscarAreiza/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OscarAreiza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OscarAreiza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OscarAreiza/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/OscarAreiza","id":143123076,"login":"OscarAreiza","node_id":"U_kgDOCIfihA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OscarAreiza/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OscarAreiza/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OscarAreiza/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OscarAreiza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OscarAreiz