2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/commits/53e594d15e4c45fa890ce9e15892805a7c8daf02"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/commits/94023ba4b6ee019ba299ecfaf567273d4cdb66f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T22:28:00Z","email":"oscar-areiza@pc1.bbrouter","name":"oscar.areiza"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T22:28:00Z","email":"oscar-areiza@pc1.bbrouter","name":"oscar.areiza"},"message":"fix(a11y): StudentsListPage — four states, request race, shell/apiClient\n\nrules/2-anexos/H-front.md, three separate requirements this page\nmissed:\n- Four mutually-exclusive states (loading/error-with-retry/empty/data)\n  instead of a red banner floating over whatever the table happened to\n  show before the request failed.\n- A newer search no longer risks being overwritten by a slower, older\n  one — each load() call is tagged with a request id, and a response\n  is only applied if it''s still the latest one in flight.\n- Consumes shell/apiClient instead of its own axios instance. The\n  inline edit form''s field errors now use ShellError.details the same\n  way StudentFormPage does, with aria-describedby next to each input.\n- Also fixes the \"new student\" link to a relative path (\"new\"), since\n  routes.tsx no longer assumes /students as this portal''s own prefix —\n  the shell decides that.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c02501e9ffd7dedcf00ff2689858ce53eb12287","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/git/trees/5c02501e9ffd7dedcf00ff2689858ce53eb12287"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/git/commits/94023ba4b6ee019ba299ecfaf567273d4cdb66f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/commit/94023ba4b6ee019ba299ecfaf567273d4cdb66f9","node_id":"C_kwDOUavmeNoAKDk0MDIzYmE0YjZlZTAxOWJhMjk5ZWNmYWY1NjcyNzNkNGNkYjY2Zjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/commit/8258c7d34f2596410a3301a9749e0b1b2877443d","sha":"8258c7d34f2596410a3301a9749e0b1b2877443d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/commits/8258c7d34f2596410a3301a9749e0b1b2877443d"}],"sha":"94023ba4b6ee019ba299ecfaf567273d4cdb66f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/commits/94023ba4b6ee019ba299ecfaf567273d4cdb66f9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/commits/8258c7d34f2596410a3301a9749e0b1b2877443d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T22:27:20Z","email":"oscar-areiza@pc1.bbrouter","name":"oscar.areiza"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T22:27:20Z","email":"oscar-areiza@pc1.bbrouter","name":"oscar.areiza"},"message":"fix(a11y): StudentFormPage — shell/apiClient, Idempotency-Key, per-field errors\n\nrules/2-anexos/H-front.md, three separate requirements this page\nmissed:\n- Consumes shell/apiClient instead of its own axios instance (the\n  federation change this whole series of commits is about).\n- Sends Idempotency-Key, one UUID per registration intent, reused on\n  every retry — a network cut mid-response no longer risks a second\n  student on resubmit, now that lms-membership-api actually honors\n  this header (lms-membership-api#10).\n- Field-level errors (ShellError.details) render next to each input\n  with aria-describedby, instead of only a generic banner at the\n  bottom of the form.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"caf4866638680777b5fdf9609d2865e3699328a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/git/trees/caf4866638680777b5fdf9609d2865e3699328a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/git/commits/8258c7d34f2596410a3301a9749e0b1b2877443d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/commit/8258c7d34f2596410a3301a9749e0b1b2877443d","node_id":"C_kwDOUavmeNoAKDgyNThjN2QzNGYyNTk2NDEwYTMzMDFhOTc0OWUwYjFiMjg3NzQ0M2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/commit/3e9d2a41cf31ef01bf18865ec696a44b0894a135","sha":"3e9d2a41cf31ef01bf18865ec696a44b0894a135","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/commits/3e9d2a41cf31ef01bf18865ec696a44b0894a135"}],"sha":"8258c7d34f2596410a3301a9749e0b1b2877443d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/commits/8258c7d34f2596410a3301a9749e0b1b2877443d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/commits/3e9d2a41cf31ef01bf18865ec696a44b0894a135/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T22:26:48Z","email":"oscar-areiza@pc1.bbrouter","name":"oscar.areiza"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T22:26:48Z","email":"oscar-areiza@pc1.bbrouter","name":"oscar.areiza"},"message":"fix(federation): main.tsx dynamically imports bootstrap.tsx\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b44b06edefc5adae6f5b2e2d222ba24d3bb273f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/git/trees/b44b06edefc5adae6f5b2e2d222ba24d3bb273f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/git/commits/3e9d2a41cf31ef01bf18865ec696a44b0894a135","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/code-corhuila/lms-membership-portal/commit/3e9d2a41cf31ef01bf18865ec696a44b0894a135","node_id":"C_kwDOUavmeNoAKDNlOWQyYTQxY2YzMWVmMDFiZjE4ODY1ZWM2OTZhNDRiMDg5NGExMzU","parents":[