"followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pipecerquera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pipecerquera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pipecerquera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Pipecerquera","id":160141915,"login":"Pipecerquera","node_id":"U_kgDOCYuSWw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pipecerquera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pipecerquera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pipecerquera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pipecerquera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pipecerquera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pipecerquera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/barber-saas-front/commits/98e91b263ac0960177275dacf76852c063505a79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T23:40:04Z","email":"dfcerquera-2023a@corhuila.edu.co","name":"Pipecerquera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T23:41:38Z","email":"160141915+Pipecerquera@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Pipecerquera"},"message":"feat(native): register the device for push after each sign-in\n\nF-4: in the installed app, the shell asks for the notification permission,\ngets the device''s FCM token with @capacitor/push-notifications and sends\nit to POST /api/v1/device-tokens for whoever signed in; a tapped\nnotification opens the Avisos inbox. android:package turns push on only\nwhen the developer''s own android/app/google-services.json is there\n(never versioned): without it the plugin would crash the app, so the\nnotices stay in the inbox.\n\nRefs: code-corhuila/barber-saas-docs#5\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e87b0813abc7d81b565a8812dbc9bb294531b636","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/barber-saas-front/git/trees/e87b0