tps://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov","id":81422814,"login":"vadimkosenkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/618a8056fa21b46b217f0bcc0510124dded31d50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T18:24:41Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T18:24:41Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"message":"fix: no description to point at in the app\n\nThe note explaining why a browser cannot vibrate is only rendered on the\nweb, but the toggle carried `aria-describedby=\"haptics-note\"` everywhere —\non iOS that is a reference to an element that does not exist. The attribute\nis now bound, so it appears only together with the note.\n\nThe test that covers it had to look in a different place: Ionic''s toggle\ndoes upgrade under jsdom, and it moves the aria attributes off its host onto\nthe real control inside its shadow root. That it moves them at all also\nshows Angular''s attribute binding lands before Ionic reads them.\n\nReported by Codex on the pull request.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ece7b912c75bf59f1526a39d651948ad05bc62e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/trees/6ece7b912c75bf59f1526a39d651948ad05bc62e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/commits/618a8056fa21b46b217f0bcc0510124dded31d50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81422814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov","id":81422814,"login":"vadimkosenkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commit/618a8056fa21b46b217f0bcc0510124dded31d50","node_id":"C_kwDOUbBGZtoAKDYxOGE4MDU2ZmEyMWI0NmIyMTdmMGJjYzA1MTAxMjRkZGVkMzFkNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commit/a0c130a0503eabfafc964a29a2464c7661c95e59","sha":"a0c130a0503eabfafc964a29a2464c7661c95e59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/a0c130a0503eabfafc964a29a2464c7661c95e59"}],"sha":"618a8056fa21b46b217f0bcc0510124dded31d50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/618a8056fa21b46b217f0bcc0510124dded31d50"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81422814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov","id":81422814,"login":"vadimkosenkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/a0c130a0503eabfafc964a29a2464c7661c95e59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T16:18:26Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T16:18:26Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"message":"feat: the size of each region, the vibration setting on the web, a tidier account card\n\nFour things a player sees, and one honest note in the docs.\n\n**How big is a region.** Choosing \"Europe\" said nothing about the length of\nthe round. Every region now carries its size — \"Europe (44)\", \"World (195)\"\n— counted from the dataset with `countriesInScope`, never from a\ntranslation, so the numbers cannot drift from the data. \"(44)\" alone tells a\nscreen reader nothing, so the bare number is hidden and the button''s\n`aria-label` spells it out, with the right plural form in both languages.\n\n**Vibration.** The setting used to vanish on the web, which looks like a\nmissing feature. It is now always there, switched off and disabled outside\nthe app, with a note saying why a browser cannot reach the taptic engine.\nIonic moves the `aria-describedby` onto the real control, so the reason is\nannounced with the switch.\n\n**The account card.** \"Sign out\" and \"Delete account\" were a filled button\nand a clear one — two different-looking controls for two things that do the\nsame kind of job. They are now the same row: an icon tile, a label, a\nchevron, hairlines across the card, and only the colour says which one is\ndestructive. \"Change\", next to the public name, was as loud as the name\nitself; it is the control size now.\n\n**The sound hint** was at body size and read as the next section''s heading.\nIt is a caption.\n\nThe blurred header of an installed app on iOS 26/27 is deliberately **not**\nfixed here. What was learned about it is written down in CLAUDE.md — the\neffect, what was ruled out as a cause, where it fades out, and why\n`status-bar-style: default` is not the answer — and the fix comes with the\nheader redesign in Phase 17, which drops `ion-header` for floating controls.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"048bbe2702bf7b0dbe0f2e09fd3907e3b2abed78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/trees/048bbe2702bf7b0dbe0f2e09fd3907e3b2abed78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/commits/a0c130a0503eabfafc964a29a2464c7661c95e59","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81422814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api