10025ec53dfdfa638fcf487dc0c1a645ec96d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/dab10025ec53dfdfa638fcf487dc0c1a645ec96d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81422814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov","id":81422814,"login":"vadimkosenkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/2e6377474527b05c6e2e6176ed08ce4a94e9299c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:36:12Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:36:12Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"message":"feat: deploy the web app with the API under its own origin\n\n- The app accepts an empty API URL, meaning the API answers under its own\n  origin; the deployment proxies /v1 to it, which is what keeps the\n  SameSite=Strict sign-in cookie first-party without buying a domain.\n  The interceptor matches on /v1/ rather than on every relative request.\n- write-deploy-config.mjs also writes Netlify''s _redirects: the proxy rule\n  and the single-page fallback, without which a reload of /home is a 404.\n- The quiz remotes ship _headers with CORS: the shell loads them from\n  another origin.\n- The API requires verified TLS for any database that is not on this\n  machine (Neon, Render, anything managed).\n- Fixes found while looking at the deployed app on a phone and a monitor:\n  the flag no longer outgrows the window''s height; the floating bars lift\n  off the bottom edge on large screens; the page follows the visible\n  viewport, so browser chrome no longer hides the last row.\n- Fix: the glass material was wrapped in `@media not\n  (prefers-reduced-transparency: reduce)`, which is false in a browser that\n  does not know the feature — the effect was off where it was supported.\n  Reduced transparency now removes it in a rule of its own.\n- Fix: the accessibility check waits for animations to finish; it measured\n  contrast mid-fade and failed in CI.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b61d6e57e53000939871c85c398fe43f2e17e48a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/trees/b61d6e57e53000939871c85c398fe43f2e17e48a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/commits/2e6377474527b05c6e2e6176ed08ce4a94e9299c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81422814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov","id":81422814,"login":"vadimkosenkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/