"gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov","id":81422814,"login":"vadimkosenkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/baad1ef6252695380b210062c1e48b6237af282e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:34:57Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T14:34:57Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"message":"feat: native sign-in on iOS, refresh token in the Keychain\n\n- The app signs in through the system (Google''s iOS SDK behind the\n  NATIVE_SIGN_IN port); Google refuses its web sign-in inside a web view.\n  The ID token goes to the same POST /v1/auth/google.\n- REFRESH_TOKEN_STORE: the httpOnly cookie on the web, the Keychain in the\n  app (refreshTokenIn: ''body'', which the API already supported). No iCloud\n  synchronisation; the rotated token replaces the stored one, signing out\n  deletes it.\n- A build without GOOGLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID says so on the welcome screen;\n  DEV_SIGN_IN=true offers the API''s development sign-in for working on\n  the app.\n- Fix: the stored token is read inside the refresh lock. The app\n  bootstraps twice, both instances presented the same token, and the API''s\n  reuse detection revoked the family — the app was signed out on every\n  restart.\n- Docs: ios.md (how 