,"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/2b385a87b700d772fa040b7db86df274c4d09606/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T13:51:16Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T13:51:16Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"message":"feat: public SSR site with legal pages and leaderboards\n\nPhase 9c (ADR-003).\n\n- apps/site (scope:site): Angular SSR on its own Node server (:4300).\n  `/` redirects by Accept-Language; home, Privacy Policy and Terms are\n  prerendered in English and Russian; the leaderboard is rendered on the\n  server per request from the public API (transfer cache, 30 s cache,\n  503 when the API is down, 404 for unknown pages); lang, canonical and\n  hreflang links. Legal texts describe the service as built; the\n  operator''s contact comes from the environment and the pages say\n  \"draft\" until it is set.\n- SSR in the shell was spiked and rejected: IndexedDB, Capacitor\n  Preferences, sign-in and Ionic break on the server, and it would\n  render only the welcome screen.\n- libs/shared/design-tokens: the token values as Sass mixins, used by\n  client/ui and the site.\n- formatRunTime moved to the quiz domain (app and site).\n- API: boards served as `public, max-age=0, must-revalidate` (the SSR\n  transfer cache refuses no-cache); CORS allows the site''s origin in\n  development.\n- Angular aligned on 22.1.7 with @angular/ssr and platform-server.\n- E2E starts the site''s production server: redirect, prerendered legal\n  pages, server-rendered board, 404, and a run played in the app showing\n  up in the site''s HTML.\n- Docs: ADR-003, site, nx, design system, overview, backend,\n  environment, setup, CI/CD, testing strategy, troubleshooting, README,\n  CLAUDE.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"111db043c63c8e563376763f35a42d48dd9db8f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/trees/111db043c63c8e563376763f35a42d48dd9db8f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/commits/2b385a87b700d772fa040b7db86df274c4d09606","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81422814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov","id":81422814,"login":"vadimkosenkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commit/2b385a87b700d772fa040b7db86df274c4d09606","node_id":"C_kwDOUbBGZtoAKDJiMzg1YTg3YjcwMGQ3NzJmYTA0MGI3ZGI4NmRmMjc0YzRkMDk2MDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commit/2d21d7796569e391d547cda0a84a3e549acf47bf","sha":"2d21d7796569e391d547cda0a84a3e549acf47bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ioni