://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/e4171cfb3a804bd1ed3505ce961fe19f267accac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:22:13Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:22:13Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"message":"feat: leaderboard challenges, rankings, records and nicknames in the app\n\nPhase 9b: the app side of the perfect-run leaderboards.\n\n- Leaderboard tab: a card starts a challenge on the chosen board\n  (POST /v1/challenges) and opens the board''s quiz with the challenge id\n  and server seed; the ranking (rank, nickname, m:ss.t time, own row\n  marked, number of players) and My records per board, with loading,\n  error/retry and empty states. Data reloads on enter and after every\n  sync.\n- Shell <-> remote contract: `mode=challenge&challenge=&seed=` query\n  params; the sink receives `{ challengeId }` and returns a promise of the\n  server''s verdict. The results screen shows checking, rank, time and\n  personal record, why a run is not ranked, or that it was not sent;\n  \"Play again\" becomes \"New challenge\".\n- Outbox requests carry the challenge id; SyncService.resultOf() gives\n  the API''s answer to a session sent now.\n- Settings > Account: edit the public nickname (validated with the API''s\n  schema), AuthStore.setNickname.\n- Fixes found by running it: the public board is `no-cache` (a cached\n  board hid a just-finished run); CORS allows PATCH (with a preflight\n  test); API tests serve the app on 127.0.0.1 (supertest could reach\n  another local server on macOS and fail at random).\n- E2E: a full 195-country challenge ranked and shown under the chosen\n  nickname; a challenge that cannot be started.\n- Docs: microfrontends contract, frontend leaderboard, leaderboard rules,\n  backend, state management, overview, testing strategy,\n  troubleshooting, README, CLAUDE.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"55aab716fcd354ad21e85bab2bf0b1563c2a58c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/trees/55aab716fcd354ad21e85bab2bf0b1563c2a58c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/commits/e4171cfb3a804bd1ed3505ce961fe19f267accac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81422814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov","id":81422814,"login":"vadimkosenkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/va