814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov","id":81422814,"login":"vadimkosenkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/e67ae6487118d0edd02d5103c3305c3fb3126b28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T08:53:59Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T08:53:59Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"message":"feat: sign-in before playing, progress on the device synced with the account\n\nPhase 8b (ADR-006, ADR-011).\n\n- Sign-in required: a /welcome screen (real dataset counts, Google''s\n  button, Apple honestly marked for the iPhone app); tabs and quizzes\n  behind signedInGuard, which lets an offline player in only if they own\n  the device''s data; back to /welcome whenever a sign-in ends.\n- libs/client/progress: ProgressStore moved from the shell; finished\n  sessions kept in IndexedDB through Dexie behind a LocalStore port, and\n  progress rebuilt from their answers in canonical order.\n- Outbox and SyncService: pending sessions sent oldest first (idempotent\n  POST /v1/sessions), then the account''s history pulled by cursor;\n  400/409/422 mark a session rejected (not counted, reported, shown in\n  Settings); offline, 5xx and 429 retry after 5 s, 30 s, 2 min, 10 min.\n  Syncs on sign-in, after each quiz, on `online` and in the foreground.\n- One account per device: signing in as another account deletes the\n  previous data; sign-out sends what is left first and asks before losing\n  unsent results; account deletion clears the device.\n- Settings > Account shows whether results are saved.\n- Fix: the quiz clock floors to whole milliseconds; fractional timestamps\n  failed the API contract and every session was rejected.\n- AUTH_RATE_LIMIT for /v1/auth (default 30 per 15 min), raised for the\n  E2E API; every E2E journey signs in with cy.signIn().\n- Tests: client-progress (store, Dexie on fake-indexeddb, mapping, sync),\n  welcome, guards, account section; E2E sync journeys.\n- Docs: ADR-006, ADR-011, state management, frontend, backend,\n  microfrontends, overview, nx, testing strategy, setup, environment,\n  troubleshooting, README, CLAUDE.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d6de32c983caa615a00992459cefc37e039dd53d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/trees/d6de32c983caa615a00992459cefc37e039dd53d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/commits/e67ae6487118d0edd02d5103c3305c3fb3126b28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81422814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"",