a56f54509607ec21043e38b3f02fbae552e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/2aab1a56f54509607ec21043e38b3f02fbae552e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81422814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov","id":81422814,"login":"vadimkosenkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/46e223d180abb27175055de47c57cab03dbb942a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:21:47Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:21:47Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"message":"feat: sign-in in the app with Google, account in Settings\n\nPhase 7b: the shell signs in against the Phase 7a API.\n\n- libs/client/auth: AuthStore (access token in memory only), sign-in API\n  calls, authInterceptor (Bearer for API requests, one shared refresh on\n  401), provideAuth() restoring the session from the httpOnly refresh\n  cookie at start-up, and Google''s button via Google Identity Services\n  with a fresh nonce per sign-in.\n- Settings > Account: sign in with Google, identity, sign out, delete the\n  account with an inline confirmation; Apple is marked as coming with the\n  iPhone app.\n- API environment moved to apps/api/.env(.example): Nx loads a root .env\n  into every task, and its PORT moved the frontend dev servers.\n- E2E starts the API (fresh PGlite, dev sign-in) and covers restoring,\n  signing out and deleting an account; start:quiz also starts the API.\n- Docs: ADR-010 web client section, frontend, setup, environment, testing,\n  CI; CLAUDE.md updated.\n\nKnown limitation (TODO in google-sign-in-button.ts): Google''s button keeps\nGoogle''s shape, and Google may show it in the language of the Google\naccount signed in to the browser rather than the app''s.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c752cb540ed4f9e2fe761c2dfdcb19e8787c699e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/trees/c752cb540ed4f9e2fe761c2dfdcb19e8787c699e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/commits/46e223d180abb27175055de47c57cab03dbb942a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81422814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov","id":81422814,"login":"vadimkosenkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","si