30f798a3b5e35b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/8cc0be28310f8dadab6702567530f798a3b5e35b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81422814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov","id":81422814,"login":"vadimkosenkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/c9f454521c30300e7c1bea1eac94cbaa6af5272e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T17:43:34Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T17:43:34Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"message":"feat: sign-in on the API with Google and Apple ID tokens\n\nPhase 7a (server side of sign-in; the app follows in 7b).\n\nSign-in (ADR-010)\n- POST /v1/auth/{google,apple}: the client sends a provider ID token; the\n  server verifies it with jose against the provider''s JWKS (signature,\n  issuer, audience = configured client ids, expiry, nonce raw or SHA-256).\n  Accounts are identified by (provider, sub), never by e-mail.\n- 15-minute HS256 access tokens (Authorization: Bearer) and opaque 256-bit\n  refresh tokens (30 days, stored as SHA-256) that rotate on every use;\n  a retired token presented again revokes its whole family.\n- Refresh token delivery chosen by the client: httpOnly SameSite=Strict\n  cookie scoped to /v1/auth (web) or the response body (native).\n- POST /v1/auth/refresh, /logout; GET /v1/me; DELETE /v1/me deletes the\n  account with identities, tokens and sessions (cascade).\n- POST /v1/auth/dev for development and E2E, only with AUTH_DEV_LOGIN=true\n  and refused in production. Sign-in endpoints are rate-limited; CORS\n  allows credentials only for configured origins.\n\nSessions\n- /v1/sessions requires sign-in; sessions belong to their player, others\n  get 404 on read and 409 on write. A deleted account''s still-valid access\n  token gets 401 instead of a foreign-key 500.\n\nDatabase\n- users, user_identities, refresh_tokens; quiz_sessions.user_id NOT NULL\n  with a foreign key. A custom data migration first removes the\n  anonymous development sessions of Phase 6.\n\nFixes\n- openPglite creates missing parent directories: `npm run start:api` on a\n  fresh checkout failed because `.data` did not exist (Phase 6 bug).\n- findOrCreate only swallows its own rollback, not every database error.\n\nConfiguration\n- AUTH_JWT_SECRET (required in production), GOOGLE_CLIENT_IDS,\n  APPLE_CLIENT_IDS, AUTH_DEV_LOGIN, CORS_ORIGINS, COOKIE_SECURE; the\n  project''s Google web client id in .env.example.\n\nTests\n- 90 API tests on PGlite and on PostgreSQL 17.11: access tokens, ID-token\n  verification against a fake provider''s JWKS, refresh rotation and reuse\n  detection, full HTTP flows, account deletion, rate limit, CORS, session\n  ownership, and concurrent first sign-ins and refreshes.\n\nDocs\n- ADR-010, backend.md (sign-in flow, endpoints, tables), environment,\n  testing strategy, phase plan (7a/7b), README and CLAUDE.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1deaa0df64817d8d6205c3ebddc50acd7002d058","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/trees/1deaa0df64817d8d6205c3ebddc50acd7002d058"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/commits/c9f454521c30300e7c1bea1eac94cbaa6af5272e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81422814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov","id":81422814,"login":"vadimkosenkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commit/c9f454521c30300e7c1bea1eac94cbaa6af5272e","node_id":"C_kwDOUbBGZtoAKGM5ZjQ1NDUyMWMzMDMwMGU3YzFiZWExZWFjOTRjYmFhNmFmNTI3MmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commit/9eae091d71df60bd72313b5e4f63e034d556a40d","sha":"9eae091d71df60bd72313b5e4f63e034d556a40d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/9eae091d71df60bd72313b5e4f63e034d556a40d"}],"sha":"c9f454521c30300e7c1bea1eac94cbaa6af5272e"