ts","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/87848dc3d60646717eb6de394fcd91c61ad2aff4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T16:40:51Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T16:40:51Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"message":"fix: address Devin review of the backend\n\n- The pg pool gets an `error` listener (createPool). A dropped idle\n  connection no longer crashes the API with an unhandled `error` event;\n  it is logged and the pool opens a new connection. Verified by\n  terminating the API''s backend in PostgreSQL 17: the process survived\n  and the next request succeeded.\n- Session ids are normalised to lower case in the contract (uuidSchema),\n  as PostgreSQL stores them: a retry that differs only in id case is the\n  same session (200, not 409), and the 201 body and Location match GET.\n- request-hash.ts and backend.md state the rule for contract changes: the\n  parsed request is hashed, so new request fields must not get a\n  .default().\n- Shutdown calls server.closeIdleConnections() after close(), so SIGTERM\n  does not wait for keep-alive connections to time out.\n- SessionRepository.answersOf is removed (only tests used it); tests read\n  answers through testing/read-answers.ts.\n- backend.md records the readiness check (SELECT 1) as planned for the\n  deployment phase; CLAUDE.md lists the pool listener and the hash rule.\n\nTests: 43 API tests on PGlite and on PostgreSQL 17.11; contract test for\nid normalisation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9749bde9007b50cfbbc73b071f1661a1215cbfca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/trees/9749bde9007b50cfbbc73b071f1661a1215cbfca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/commits/87848dc3d60646717eb6de394fcd91c61ad2aff4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81422814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov","id":81422814,"login":"vadimkosenkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commit/87848dc3d60646717eb6de394fcd91c61ad2aff4","node_id":"C_kwDOUbBGZtoAKDg3ODQ4ZGMzZDYwNjQ2NzE3ZWI2ZGUzOTRmY2Q5MWM2MWFkMmFmZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commit/960c72f100f409a8797c495bd76251a836900fd7","sha":"960c72f100f409a8797c495bd76251a836900fd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/960c72f100f409a8797c495bd76251a836900fd7"}],"sha":"87848dc3d60646717eb6de394fcd91c61ad2aff4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/87848dc3d60646717eb6de394fcd91c61ad2aff4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81422814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov","id":81422814,"login":"vadimkosenkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/960c72f100f409a8797c495bd76251a836900fd7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T15:36:19Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T15:36:19Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"message":"feat: API records quiz sessions in PostgreSQL, graded by the server\n\nPhase 6: Express 5 API with PostgreSQL through Drizzle, SQL migrations,\nand recording of finished quiz sessions that the server re-grades itself.\n\nContract\n- New libs/shared/contracts (scope:shared, type:contracts): Zod schemas\n  of the session request/response and RFC 9457 problem details. The\n  request type is exactly the domain''s SessionRecord (compile-time check);\n  the schema is strict, so fields such as `score` are rejected.\n\nAPI\n- POST /v1/sessions: parse with the contract, check plausibility (not in\n  the future, not before start, at most 24 h), replay the session with\n  quiz-domain (questions regenerated from the seed, every answer\n  re-graded), and store only the server''s results. Sessions that cannot\n  be replayed are rejected with 422 and a reason, never corrected.\n- Idempotency: client-generated UUID + SHA-256 of the canonical request;\n  a retry returns the stored result (200), a different body under the\n  same id is a conflict (409), racing requests are resolved by the\n  primary key and ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING.\n- GET /v1/sessions/:id. Every error is application/problem+json; 413 for\n  large bodies, 400 for malformed JSON, 500 logged without details.\n- Layers: routes -> service -> repository -> database; createApp() takes\n  its dependencies, main.ts is the composition root.\n\nDatabase\n- Drizzle schema (quiz_sessions, quiz_answers) with check constraints and\n  cascade; drizzle-kit migration committed; `nx run api:db-generate`.\n- pg pool for DATABASE_URL, PGlite on disk (.data/pglite) otherwise;\n  production requires DATABASE_URL. Migrations run at start-up.\n\nTests\n- 41 API tests (config, hashing, repository on real SQL, HTTP flows) on\n  in-memory PGlite, and on PostgreSQL with TEST_DATABASE_URL (temporary\n  database per test file, part of the Nx cache key). Verified on\n  PostgreSQL 17.11, including two identical requests racing each other.\n- 12 contract tests.\n\nDocs\n- ADR-005 (PostgreSQL + Drizzle, PGlite), docs/architecture/backend.md,\n  environment, setup, testing strategy, nx, overview, README, CLAUDE.md.\n\nNot yet: authentication (sessions are anonymous), rate limiting, and the\napp sending sessions (offline sync, Phase 8).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e4f3e1902ddd304ce82bf304e1876516e8859e83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/trees/e4f3e1902ddd304ce82bf304e1876516e8859e83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/commits/960c72f100f409a8797c495bd76251a836900fd7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81422814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov","id":81422814,"login":"vadimkosenkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commit/960c72f100f409a8797c495bd76251a836900fd7","node_id":"C_kwDOUbBGZtoAKDk2MGM3MmYxMDBmNDA5YTg3OTdjNDk1YmQ3NjI1MWE4MzY5MDBmZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commit/b5aaed30afa4a5814b8953a7ce85c13415fc1367","sha":"b5aaed30afa4a5814b8953a7ce85c13415fc1367","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/b5aaed30afa4a5814b8953a7ce85c13415fc1367"}],"sha":"960c72f100f409a8797c495bd76251a836900fd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-worl