tps://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/f605ad1cc1ec8225ae6a684041e3f03d4bab7538/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T17:02:52Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T17:02:52Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"message":"fix: address Devin review of the Flags microfrontend\n\n- QuizPage is no longer exported from the quiz-feature barrel, so the\n  import() in quizRemoteRoutes produces a real lazy chunk. The remotes''\n  route specs identify the loaded page by its selector.\n- QuizPage resets in ionViewDidLeave instead of guarding the second\n  ionViewWillEnter: the latter also fires when an iOS swipe-back is\n  started and cancelled, which would restart a quiz in progress.\n- main.ts in shell, capitals and flags: `.then(() => import(...))`\n  clears the unused-parameter lint warnings (0 left in the workspace).\n- Rewrap the routes doc comment in the shell.\n\nAlso found while addressing the review: the control-character rule in\nCLAUDE.md contained U+FFFD, because the example escape sequence was\ndecoded on its way into the file. The rule now describes the sequence\nin words, and check:control-chars also fails on U+FFFD.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dcbf9847f690d995c54faa116756df78d4f89a53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/trees/dcbf9847f690d995c54faa116756df78d4f89a53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/commits/f605ad1cc1ec8225ae6a684041e3f03d4bab7538","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81422814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov","id":81422814,"login":"vadimkosenkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commit/f605ad1cc1ec8225ae6a684041e3f03d4bab7538","node_id":"C_kwDOUbBGZtoAKGY2MDVhZDFjYzFlYzgyMjVhZTZhNjg0MDQxZTNmMDNkNGJhYjc1Mzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commit/c14f758c244d6e4c1eb5eecdb1ac1d70589f77d2","sha":"c14f758c244d6e4c1eb5eecdb1ac1d70589f77d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/c14f758c244d6e4c1eb5eecdb1ac1d70589f77d2"}],"sha":"f605ad1cc1ec8225ae6a684041e3f03d4bab7538","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/f605ad1cc1ec8225ae6a684041e3f03d4bab7538"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81422814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov","id":81422814,"login":"vadimkosenkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/c14f758c244d6e4c1eb5eecdb1ac1d70589f77d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:07:26Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:07:26Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"message":"feat: Flags quiz as a second Native Federation microfrontend\n\nThe shell now composes two remotes at runtime: Capitals (:4201) and\nFlags (:4202), both loaded over Native Federation.\n\nShared quiz page instead of a copy\n- QuizPage moves from apps/capitals into client/quiz-feature and takes\n  its category from route data; quizRemoteRoutes(category) is what each\n  remote exposes as ./routes. A remote keeps its own build, dev server,\n  remoteEntry.json and URL, but no screens of its own.\n- The in-memory ports for standalone remotes move into client/quiz-ports\n  as provideInMemoryQuizPorts().\n\nFlags remote\n- apps/flags becomes a federation remote like capitals: federation config,\n  bootstrap split, Ionic CSS and flag assets, standalone dev app.\n- Shell: manifest entry, /quiz/flags route with the quiz ports.\n\nShell\n- Home''s category cards open the setup with ?category= preselected\n  (linkedSignal over the bound query input).\n- The \"not available yet\" gate for Flags and its texts are removed.\n\nStarting a quiz no longer shows the previous results\n- Ionic''s ion-router-outlet can reuse a cached page for the same URL.\n  Leaving the quiz now uses NavController.navigateRoot(''/home''), and\n  QuizPage starts a new quiz when Ionic shows it again.\n\nTooling, tests and docs\n- start:quiz and the E2E web servers run shell, capitals and flags;\n  shell-e2e depends on flags.\n- Tests: QuizPage for Flags, re-entry and exit; both remotes'' routes;\n  setup preselection; Home links; Flags E2E journey, mistakes, Hard-mode\n  placeholder, fresh quiz after going home.\n- microfrontends.md (\"Two remotes, one page\"), ADR-002, overview,\n  frontend, setup, troubleshooting, CI/CD, testing strategy, README and\n  CLAUDE.md updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6898872277788588c764863a01d9275aeac435c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/trees/6898872277788588c764863a01d9275aeac435c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/commits/c14f758c244d6e4c1eb5eecdb1ac1d70589f77d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81422814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov","id":81422814,"login":"vadimkosenkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","rece