ov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/36c0e607cdc6e12fcababd0a039ded9580361b66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T14:59:46Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T14:59:46Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"message":"fix: address Devin review of the Capitals microfrontend\n\n- Capitals: `?count=` falls back to the default unless it is a positive\n  whole number, the same rule as the domain. `count=0` used to make the\n  engine reject the config and QuizSessionStore throw inside QuizPlay.\n- Capitals: merge the two imports from @world-quiz/client/quiz-ports.\n- Quiz exit abandons the session: QuizPlay no longer stops it on exit, so\n  nothing is emitted through `finished`, no results flash before leaving,\n  and no answers are recorded. Only finished quizzes reach the shell\n  (all questions answered, Timed expired, Endless \"Finish\").\n- The answer verdict is its own component, wq-answer-feedback, which keeps\n  quiz-play.scss within the 4 kB component style budget.\n\nTests: AnswerFeedback (correct, mistake, typo), exit emits no finished\nsession, the page records nothing on exit, and invalid counts fall back.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e563c3505db535425b0a273eb1a55352a26b3d0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/