607cdc6e12fcababd0a039ded9580361b66"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81422814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vadimkosenkov","id":81422814,"login":"vadimkosenkov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNDIyODE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vadimkosenkov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/commits/723aef96c2dfea492361e11d6a688253cd63f907/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T14:07:19Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T14:07:19Z","email":"vadimkosenkov.work@gmail.com","name":"vadimkosenkov"},"message":"feat: Capitals quiz as a Native Federation microfrontend\n\nThe shell becomes a dynamic Native Federation host and loads the Capitals\nquiz from a separately built and served remote at /quiz/capitals.\n\nFederation\n- shell: initFederation(federation.manifest.json) before bootstrap;\n  capitals: remote exposing ./routes, typed by QuizRemoteRoutesModule.\n- The shell provides the quiz ports on the federated route; the remote\n  never touches the shell''s stores.\n- loadQuizRemoteRoutes reports load failures via ErrorHandler and shows a\n  recoverable \"Quiz unavailable\" page instead of a blank outlet.\n- Workspace libraries are shared through tsconfig path mappings, so the\n  dataset, domain and tokens exist once at runtime.\n\nLibraries\n- client/quiz-ports: QUIZ_RESULT_SINK, QUIZ_PROGRESS_READER,\n  COUNTRY_DATASET, CLOCK and the remote routes contract.\n- client/quiz-feature: QuizSessionStore, wq-quiz-play, wq-quiz-results,\n  quiz icons, and a testing entry point.\n- quiz/domain/testing entry point with the fixture dataset.\n\nScreens\n- Quiz setup in the shell (category, region, difficulty, mode); Flags is\n  shown disabled until its remote exists. Home links Capitals to setup.\n- Quiz: question above the flag, full-width flag, verdict under the flag,\n  the correct answer emphasised after a mistake, Hard-mode autofocus.\n- Results with score, accuracy, time, review list and unlocked\n  achievements. Every next step sits in a bottom action bar.\n\nDesign system\n- Ionic CSS listed in project styles (the federation dev server does not\n  resolve package @imports), one glass material for tab bar and headers,\n  permanent page headers, control type scale, visible progress track,\n  vivid feedback tints, tab label descenders no longer clipped.\n\nTooling and docs\n- start:quiz serves shell + capitals; E2E starts both production builds.\n- jsdom setup moved to tools/testing; capitals has component tests.\n- docs/architecture/microfrontends.md; ADR-002 marked implemented for\n  Capitals; frontend, design-system, testing, setup, troubleshooting,\n  CI/CD, overview and README updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ba75a68ebd3d05ecb3b1067370106a78223d345","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/trees/0ba75a68ebd3d05ecb3b1067370106a78223d345"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vadimkosenkov/angular-ionic-nx-mf-world-quiz/git/commits/723aef96c2dfea492361e11d6a688253cd63f907","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signat