are pre-bundled explicitly; tsconfig paths resolve in the\n  dependency scanner; the router plugin''s HMR glue targets a per-remote router\n  registry instead of window.__TSR_ROUTER__ (the shell''s router, whose root\n  route is also __root__ and was being overwritten by the remote''s).\n- @platform/react: MFE routers register in globalThis.__PLATFORM_TSR_ROUTERS__\n  while mounted and leave window.__TSR_ROUTER__ untouched.\n- @platform/host: concurrent loads share one in-flight task; a caller''s abort\n  detaches only that caller, aborted mounts are debug logs, not failures.\n- module-federation: dev remotes report their shared packages as own copies.\n- conformance shell: dev config always derives from PLATFORM_* variables;\n  react-aria pre-bundled for the linked host package.\n- docs, decisions 8 and 9, regression tests; repository formatted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012jL1JKH3T6fi4QUXK6NWqz","tree":{"sha":"c2a8737bdd896d359eeec58675b9bbb5a718398f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform-2/git/trees/c2a8737bdd896d359eeec58675b9bbb5a718398f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform-2/git/commits/16bc452929fb1647c3d51f6278845afc97e998d7","verification":{"payload":"tree c2a8737bdd896d359eeec58675b9bbb5a718398f\nparent 7c9907746f25453c98fb1307283a1963a6b833e8\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789441647 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789441647 +0000\n\nfix(dev): make development remotes mount and hot-update inside the SSR shell\n\n- @platform/vite: dev servers register shared packages in a private share\n  scope (react19:dev:<mfeId>) and run on their own copies; Tecton''s JavaScript\n  dependencies are pre-bundled explicitly; tsconfig paths resolve in the\n  dependency scanner; the router plugin''s HMR glue targets a per-remote router\n  registry instead of window.__TSR_ROUTER__ (the shell''s router, whose root\n  route is also __root__ and was being overwritten by the remote''s).\n- @platform/react: MFE routers register in globalThis.__PLATFORM_TSR_ROUTERS__\n  while mounted and leave window.__TSR_ROUTER__ untouched.\n- @platform/host: concurrent loads share one in-flight task; a caller''s abort\n  detaches only that caller, aborted mounts are debug logs, not failures.\n- module-federation: dev remotes report their shared packages as own copies.\n- conformance shell: dev config always derives from PLATFORM_* variables;\n  react-aria pre-bundled for the linked host package.\n- docs, decisions 8 and 9, regression tests; repository formatted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012jL1JKH3T6fi4QUXK6NWqz\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDxt+RZB\nOiGdHfxIeQXLOmPhGCcLmERGW1Hqeweqf+ARfMDXv6idqYoO+GgyzWHvugt3cUu14E7e4HUU/pn7\n8gU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-15T03:07:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-platform-2/commit/16bc452929fb1647c3d51f6278845afc97e998d7","node_id":"C_kwDOUbKFU9oAKDE2YmM0NTI5MjlmYjE2NDdjM2Q1MWY2Mjc4ODQ1YWZjOTdlOTk4ZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-platform-2/commit/7c9907746f25453c98fb1307283a1963a6b833e8","sha":"7c9907746f25453c98fb1307283a1963a6b833e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform-2/commits/7c9907746f25453c98fb1307283a1963a6b833e8"}],"sha":"16bc452929fb1647c3d51f6278845afc97e998d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform-2/commits/16bc452929fb1647c3d51f6278845afc97e998d7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform-2/commits/7c9907746f25453c98fb1307283a1963a6b833e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T02:14:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T02:14:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(core): actually bundle the SDK per remote (reason per-remote); parallel E2E with tighter timeouts\n\nThe per-remote rule was declared but never applied, so every remote still\nshared @platform/react and its Tecton portal adapter. Whichever remote loaded\nfirst then provided the React Aria portal context for the others and their\noverlays landed in document.body instead of the owner-tagged overlay root.\nThe SDK is now bundled per remote unless a remote opts in explicitly; docs\nand JSON schemas updated. Playwright runs the production project in\nparallel with 40s/10s timeouts; the HMR project runs serially.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012jL1JKH3T6fi4QUXK6NWqz","tree":{"sha":"cd1c1bfbb756537c811ce584ca46626fdc05d755","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform-2/git/trees/cd1c1bfbb756537c811ce584ca46626fdc05d755"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-platform-2/git/commits/7c9907746f25453c98fb1307283a1963a6b833e8","verification":{"payload":"tree cd1c1bfbb756537c811ce584ca46626fdc05d755\nparent b479e11933075bb3e1fb2e8c96d8380fe00b84f2\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789438494 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789438494 +0000\n\nfix(core): actually bundle the SDK per remote (reason per-remote); parallel E2E with tighter timeouts\n\nThe per-remote rule was declared but never applied, so every remote still\nshared @platform/react and its Tecton portal adapter. Whichever remote loaded\nfirst then provided the React Aria portal context for the others and their\noverlays landed in document.body instead of the owner-tagged overlay root.\nThe SDK is now bundled per remote unless a remote opts in explicitly; docs\nand JSON schemas updated. Playwright runs the production project in\nparallel with 40s/10s timeouts; the HMR project runs serially.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012jL1JKH3T6fi4QUXK6NWqz\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----B