ts{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bif26","id":246143052,"login":"bif26","node_id":"U_kgDODqvYTA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commits/2d3b23fea278d5c86145cac09faaee94e58076ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T20:07:14Z","email":"bif26@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bif26"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T20:07:14Z","email":"bif26@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bif26"},"message":"fix(warmup): non-blocking model load + load-aware watchdog (v0.9.1)\n\nWarmup froze the backend: engine.swap_model() ran directly on the uvicorn\nevent loop, so /api/health + /api/status went silent for the whole\ntorch-import + weight load (first run also downloads 1.26 GB). The\ncontroller''s freeze watchdog saw 30s of silence and SIGKILLed the backend\nmid-load — warmup could never finish (RAM stuck at ~60 MB, ''none (cold)'').\n\nBackend:\n- engine: background-thread warmup with a cold → loading → loaded | error\n  state machine; start_warmup() returns immediately; try_unload() never\n  blocks on the engine lock; unload_model() now returns heap to the OS\n  (double gc.collect + malloc_trim) and resets state\n- /api/warmup: fire-and-forget (answers in <100ms); progress via\n  /api/status → model_state + load{state,target,error,elapsed_s}\n- /api/score + /api/live: all CPU-bound work (librosa preprocess, Wav2Vec2\n  inference, Whisper transcribe, swap-back) moved to the threadpool\n- controller watchdog: while backend reports loading, CPU>95% freeze kill\n  and idle auto-stop are paused, unresponsive budget widens 30s → 120s,\n  RAM breaker (2500 MB) stays active; stuck loads killed after 15 min\n- config: RAM thresholds 1500/1800/2048 → 1600/2000/2300 (large-XLSR\n  steady RSS ~1.3-1.6 GB used to flirt with the 1800 auto-unload line);\n  model ids env-overridable (DE_COACH_WAV2VEC2_MODEL/DE_COACH_WHISPER_MODEL)\n- engine: low_cpu_mem_usage weight streaming (accelerate) — loads the\n  .bin via mmap instead of materialising a second copy; steady RSS ~360 MB\n  idle-mapped, ~1.3-1.6 GB after first inference\n- shell scripts: drop deprecated TRANSFORMERS_CACHE export (FutureWarning)\n\nFrontend:\n- System page Model card: live loading state (spinner + elapsed + progress),\n  error surface, success toast on loading → loaded, buttons disable mid-load\n- Dashboard model stat reflects loading/error; RAM fallbacks updated; v0.9.1\n\nTests: 4 new regression tests (12 total pass); E2E 15/15 with tiny HF model\nthrough real controller+backend (health polled 0 failures mid-load, SIGSTOP\nwatchdog kill still works); real facebook/wav2vec2-large-xlsr-53-german\n11/11 (25.8s cold load, 0 failed health polls, 0 freeze kills, unload clean);\nbrowser-verified warmup click → loading card → loaded card in the built UI","tree":{"sha":"1ab802f791040c9fcdb8d9abed1871d931dc4079","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/git/trees/1ab802f791040c9fcdb8d9abed1871d931dc4079"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/git/commits/2d3b23fea278d5c86145cac09faaee94e58076ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246143052?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/events