tps://api.github.com/users/bif26/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commits/f76da2ef5f42a584eb4949401fa4c3b3d933e8e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T19:28:10Z","email":"bif26@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bif26"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T19:28:10Z","email":"bif26@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bif26"},"message":"v0.9.0: new ports (33111/22111), soft-light pastel theme, theme-aware charts, docs UI v4\n\nPorts\n- Backend (FastAPI): 8765 -> 22111\n- Controller (frontend + orchestrator): 8766 -> 33111\n- Updated across backend, frontend, start/stop/setup scripts, systemd units, PKGBUILD, README and docs\n\nWeb UI\n- daisyUI soft-light ''pastel'' theme is now the DEFAULT (aqua stays as dark option)\n- New src/lib/chartTheme.ts: charts read daisyUI CSS vars at render time and\n  auto-detect OKLCH (daisyUI >= 4.12) vs HSL component format\n- Dashboard: weekly score trend line chart + daisyUI radial-progress readiness\n- System: RAM doughnut gauge with % of ceiling\n- Analytics/Progress: gradient area fills, hover styling, legend polish\n- All charts re-skin instantly on theme toggle\n- Fixed: canvas-mounted-before-data race (charts drew blank), raw template\n  literal in readiness card, oklch addColorStop crash\n\nDocs (GitHub Pages)\n- v4 UI: full-width cover sections (hero + all sections now edge-to-edge),\n  420px-tall charts, violet/sky/emerald palette, Nunito display font\n- New ''Web UI Screenshots'' gallery on the cover (7 screenshots)\n- Fixed dark-on-dark hero text (CSS specificity) and doubled chapter H1s\n- Version badge -> v0.9.0, quick-start ports updated\n\nREADME\n- Screenshots table, new ports everywhere, daisyUI/charts feature notes,\n  v0.9.0 release row","tree":{"sha":"d3c4c33ed24743d45022127fefeb21c6660a33bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/git/trees/d3c4c33ed24743d45022127fefeb21c6660a33bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/git/commits/f76da2ef5f42a584eb4949401fa4c3b3d933e8e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246143052?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bif26","id":246143052,"login":"bif26","node_id":"U_kgDODqvYTA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commit/f76da2ef5f42a584eb4949401fa4c3b3d933e8e1","node_id":"C_kwDOUbLk3NoAKGY3NmRhMmVmNWY0MmE1ODRlYjQ5NDk0MDFmYTRjM2IzZDkzM2U4ZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commit/2d12c389af5b6559e07053abf4b1c0f4ae353ced","sha":"2d12c389af5b6559e07053abf4b1c0f4ae353ced","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commits/2d12c389af5b6559e07053abf4b1c0f4ae353ced"}],"sha":"f76da2ef5f42a584eb4949401fa4c3b3d933e8e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commits/f76da2ef5f42a584eb4949401fa4c3b3d933e8e1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246143052?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bif26","id":246143052,"login":"bif26","node_id":"U_kgDODqvYTA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commits/2d12c389af5b6559e07053abf4b1c0f4ae353ced/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T18:53:39Z","email":"bif26@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bif26"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T18:53:53Z","email":"bif26@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bif26"},"message":"v0.8.0: WebSocket realtime channel, full-width layout, backend boot fixes\n\nLayout:\n- Remove max-w-7xl centered column; content now stretches edge-to-edge\n  (matches navbar width) with responsive padding only\n\nRealtime (the big one):\n- New WebSocket endpoint /ws on the controller: snapshot + 1s status ticks\n  + backend log push + ping/pong. One shared 1 Hz loop caches status so\n  every browser tab costs O(1)\n- Frontend lib/realtime.ts: auto-reconnect w/ backoff, keepalive ping,\n  feeds controllerStatus/backendStatus/backendDown/liveLogs stores\n- Legacy 5s REST pollers + SSE log stream kept only as fallback\n- System page: live WS badge, real request-rate stat, start button waits\n  for backend readiness (ready + waited_s)\n- vite dev proxy for /ws (ws: true)\n\nBackend boot blockers fixed (backend could never start before):\n- schema.sql: Python-style docstring header was invalid SQL ->\n  sqlite3.OperationalError on every startup; converted to -- comments\n- controller: missing ''global'' declarations in _read_logs, _monitor_loop\n  and proxy_to_backend caused UnboundLocalError -> log streaming, freeze\n  monitor and request tracking were dead on arrival\n- proxy: httpx client was closed before StreamingResponse consumed the\n  body -> intermittent mid-response IncompleteRead; client now closed in\n  stream finally\n- POST /api/controller/start now waits until /api/health responds\n\nDocs: README + docs/markdown/13-api-spec.md section 13.0 (WS protocol)\nTests: 8/8 scorer unit tests, svelte-check clean, e2e 21/21 x3 runs","tree":{"sha":"ef633910f6bc7d7f66c545100ead821528b5cc03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/git/trees/ef633910f6bc7d7f66c545100ead821528b5cc03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/git/commits/2d12c389af5b6559e07053abf4b1c0f4ae353ced","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246143052?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bif26","id":246143052,"login":"bif26","node_id":"U_kgDODqvYTA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commit/2d12c389af5b6559e07053abf4b1c0f4ae353ced","node_id":"C_kwDOUbLk3NoAKDJkMTJjMzg5YWY1YjY1NTllMDcwNTNhYmY0YjFjMGY0YWUzNTNjZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commit/10df7c678e30ef6416dabee498447af9aa3b51d0","sha":"10df7c678e30ef6416dabee498447af9aa3b51d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commits/10df7c678e30ef6416dabee498447af9aa3b51d0"}],"sha":"2d12c389af5b6559e07053abf4b1c0f4ae353ced","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commits/2d12c389af5b6559e07053abf4b1c0f4ae353ced"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168761?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SuperZ","id":168761,"login":"SuperZ","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperZ","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commits/10df7c678e30ef6416dabee498447af9aa3b51d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T18:20:09Z","email":"superz@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Super Z"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T18:20:09Z","email":"superz@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Super Z"},"message":"fix(ui): stylesheet never imported — ship CSS in build + fix store TDZ crash (v0.7.2)\n\nRoot causes of the unstyled, broken UI:\n\n1. app.css (Tailwind + daisyUI) was never imported after the v0.7.0\n   frontend rebuild. The build emitted zero CSS and the app rendered\n   as raw unstyled HTML. Fixed by importing it in the root +layout.\n\n2. ReferenceError (TDZ) in startBackendPolling(): the\n   ''const unsub = store.subscribe(v => { unsub(); ... })'' pattern\n   throws because Svelte invokes subscribers synchronously. Replaced\n   with get(store). This also fixes the RAM/backend status pill.\n\n3. Stale v0.3.0 version strings in Nav, footer, settings, package.json\n   → all bumped to v0.7.2.\n\nController hardening (same symptom, different systems):\n- Explicit MIME override map so .css/.js are never served as\n  text/plain on hosts without /etc/mime.types (Chrome silently\n  refuses such stylesheets).\n- index.html served with no-store; hashed immutable assets cached\n  for 1y so frontend updates actually reach the browser.\n- Path traversal guard in the SPA fallback route.\n\nTests: headless-browser E2E across all 9 routes — 20/20 pass,\n0 console errors; svelte-check clean; backend pytest 8/8.","tree":{"sha":"2ff34b142f350a3aa25e5e609a8716404f568600","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/git/trees/2ff34b142f350a3aa25e5e609a8716404f568600"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/git/commits/10df7c678e30ef6416dabee498447af9aa3b51d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168761?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SuperZ","id":168761,"login"