l":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bif26","id":246143052,"login":"bif26","node_id":"U_kgDODqvYTA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commit/3bbddcf0baa8b3fcffacc2ca178262d569e3497a","node_id":"C_kwDOUbLk3NoAKDNiYmRkY2YwYmFhOGIzZmNmZmFjYzJjYTE3ODI2MmQ1NjllMzQ5N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commit/7596eb2c29cef2ad328ef92af98d93624e8c6f8f","sha":"7596eb2c29cef2ad328ef92af98d93624e8c6f8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commits/7596eb2c29cef2ad328ef92af98d93624e8c6f8f"}],"sha":"3bbddcf0baa8b3fcffacc2ca178262d569e3497a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commits/3bbddcf0baa8b3fcffacc2ca178262d569e3497a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246143052?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bif26","id":246143052,"login":"bif26","node_id":"U_kgDODqvYTA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commits/7596eb2c29cef2ad328ef92af98d93624e8c6f8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T03:13:11Z","email":"bif26@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bif26"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T03:13:11Z","email":"bif26@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bif26"},"message":"docs: add Markdown source of truth for architecture spec (v0.6.1)\n\nThe architecture PDF (docs/architecture.pdf) was the only canonical source,\nbut PDF is hard to read fast and hard to extract specific info from. The\nextracted txt file lost data (tables became garbled, code blocks lost\nformatting).\n\nAdded docs/markdown/ as the new SOURCE OF TRUTH:\n  - 19 chapter files (01-executive-summary.md through 19-roadmap.md)\n  - README.md with TL;DR + quick reference tables\n  - INDEX.md mapping files to chapters\n  - 1,446 lines total, all human-readable Markdown\n\nEach chapter preserves:\n  - Full text content from the PDF\n  - Tables in Markdown format (rendered by GitHub)\n  - Code blocks with syntax highlighting\n  - RAM budget tables, API specs, schema SQL\n  - Architecture diagrams as ASCII art\n\nBenefits:\n  - Fast to read (any text editor or GitHub web UI)\n  - Easy to search (grep, GitHub search)\n  - Easy to edit (just edit the .md file)\n  - Renders natively on GitHub (no PDF viewer needed)\n  - Can be converted to PDF, HTML, or any format later\n\nThe PDF and web UI (docs/index.html) remain as alternative formats,\nbut the Markdown files are now the canonical source — when the\narchitecture changes, edit the .md files first.\n\ndocs/markdown/README.md includes:\n  - TL;DR with architecture at a glance\n  - RAM budget table\n  - Key design decisions\n  - Setup commands\n  - API quick reference\n  - Links to all 19 chapters\n\ndocs/markdown/INDEX.md maps each .md file to its chapter number\nand title for easy navigation.","tree":{"sha":"b1ad7d9a51ce7820b887a8d465516fbf3cc80d80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/git/trees/b1ad7d9a51ce7820b887a8d465516fbf3cc80d80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/git/commits/7596eb2c29cef2ad328ef92af98d93624e8c6f8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246143052?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bif26","id":246143052,"login":"bif26","node_id":"U_kgDODqvYTA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commit/7596eb2c29cef2ad328ef92af98d93624e8c6f8f","node_id":"C_kwDOUbLk3NoAKDc1OTZlYjJjMjljZWYyYWQzMjhlZjkyYWY5OGQ5MzYyNGU4YzZmOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commit/077d599fc3ec4a47729ba543c23fd96344f1e041","sha":"077d599fc3ec4a47729ba543c23fd96344f1e041","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commits/077d599fc3ec4a47729ba543c23fd96344f1e041"}],"sha":"7596eb2c29cef2ad328ef92af98d93624e8c6f8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commits/7596eb2c29cef2ad328ef92af98d93624e8c6f8f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246143052?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bif26","id":246143052,"login":"bif26","node_id":"U_kgDODqvYTA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commits/077d599fc3ec4a47729ba543c23fd96344f1e041/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T02:43:41Z","email":"bif26@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bif26"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T02:43:41Z","email":"bif26@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bif26"},"message":"feat: implement PDF spec — dual-model auto-swap engine (v0.6.0)\n\nRe-read the architecture PDF and implemented Chapter 7 exactly:\n- /api/score uses Wav2Vec2 (auto-swaps from Whisper if needed)\n- /api/live uses Whisper (auto-swaps from Wav2Vec2 if needed)\n- Single-model-at-a-time rule: never both in RAM simultaneously\n- swap_model() atomically unloads-then-loads (from PDF pseudo-code)\n\nWav2Vec2 model: facebook/wav2vec2-large-xlsr-53-german (public, HTTP 200)\nThe base model is private (401) but the large variant works.\n~1.2 GB RAM but under 2 GB ceiling (only one model loaded at a time).","tree":{"sha":"466d5690441cf0a5e8557944902b5aa432dbae06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/git/trees/466d5690441cf0a5e8557944902b5aa432dbae06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/git/commits/077d599fc3ec4a47729ba543c23fd96344f1e041","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246143052?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bif26","id":246143052,"login":"bif26","node_id":"U_kgDODqvYTA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commit/077d599fc3ec4a47729ba543c23fd96344f1e041","node_id":"C_kwDOUbLk3NoAKDA3N2Q1OTlmYzNlYzRhNDc3MjliYTU0M2MyM2ZkOTYzNDRmMWUwNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commit/7fde45eb06a7ae6825297baa575568f3e4743c9f","sha":"7fde45eb06a7ae6825297baa575568f3e4743c9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commits/7fde45eb06a7ae6825297baa575568f3e4743c9f"}],"sha":"077d599fc3ec4a47729ba543c23fd96344f1e041","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commits/077d599fc3ec4a47729ba543c23fd96344f1e041"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246143052?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bif26","id":246143052,"login":"bif26","node_id":"U_kgDODqvYTA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/commits/7fde45eb06a7ae6825297baa575568f3e4743c9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T02:34:33Z","email":"bif26@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bif26"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T02:34:33Z","email":"bif26@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bif26"},"message":"feat: dual-backend ASR — Whisper (default) + Wav2Vec2 large (optional) (v0.5.1)\n\nThe user found that facebook/wav2vec2-large-xlsr-53-german IS accessible\n(HTTP 200) — only the BASE model (wav2vec2-base-german) is private (401).\nThe large model was always the architecture spec''s first choice; we only\nswitched to Whisper-only in v0.5.0 because we thought ALL Wav2Vec2 German\nmodels were gated.\n\nNow the engine supports BOTH backends:\n\n  Default: Whisper tiny int8 (~150 MB RAM)\n    - Safe for 8 GB machines\n    - Good accuracy for exam prep\n    - Set via: DE_COACH_ASR_BACKEND=whisper (default)\n\n  Optional: Wav2Vec2 large xlsr-53-german (~1.2 GB RAM)\n    - Better character-level phonetic accuracy\n    - Better for German suffix/umlaut detection (Layers 3+4 of scorer)\n    - Set via: DE_COACH_ASR_BACKEND=wav2vec2\n    - Requires more RAM but stays under 2 GB ceiling\n\nChanges:\n  backend/core/engine.py:\n    - Dual backend with lazy loading\n    - ensure_model() checks config.asr_backend and loads the right one\n    - swap_model(''whisper''|''wav2vec2'') switches at runtime\n    - transcribe_scoring() uses Wav2Vec2 if loaded (char-level accuracy)\n      or Whisper beam_size=5 as fallback\n    - transcribe_live_stream() always uses Whisper (streaming)\n\n  backend/config.py:\n    - Added asr_backend setting (env: DE_COACH_ASR_BACKEND)\n    - Added wav2vec2_model_id = ''facebook/wav2vec2-large-xlsr-53-german''\n    - Kept whisper_model_id + whisper_compute_type\n\n  backend/requirements.txt:\n    - Re-added transformers==4.49.0 (for Wav2Vec2)\n    - torch installed separately by setup.sh (CPU-only wheel)\n    - faster-whisper kept for live mode\n\n  setup.sh:\n    - Re-added torch install step (Step 4/7)\n    - Now 7 steps (was 6 in v0.5.0)\n    - Both backends available; user picks via env var\n\n  scripts/fetch_models.sh:\n    - Downloads BOTH models by default\n    - --whisper-only flag skips Wav2Vec2 (saves ~1.2 GB disk)\n    - --check verifies both\n\nVerified end-to-end:\n  - torch 2.13.0+cpu installs via prebuilt wheel\n  - transformers 4.49.0 + tokenizers 0.21.4 (abi3 wheel) install cleanly\n  - faster_whisper imports OK\n  - All deps work on Python 3.14 without source builds","tree":{"sha":"bdd46146a30c82cea7b9fa9e30627bf839d9d858","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/git/trees/bdd46146a30c82cea7b9fa9e30627bf839d9d858"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HeaTTap/Local_DE_Coach/git/commits/7fde45eb06a7ae6825297baa575568f3e4743c9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246143052?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bif26/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html