url":"https://api.github.com/users/changbaebang-29cm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changbaebang/unprovided/commits/000b72d70daef296496c6be1e126b4fd374e8536/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T05:30:54Z","email":"changbae.bang@29cm.co.kr","name":"방창배(changbae bang)"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T05:30:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: drop setup-node registry-url so npm performs the OIDC exchange (#14)\n\nWith registry-url set, setup-node writes an empty _authToken to .npmrc;\nnpm treats that as credentials and never exchanges the OIDC token, so\npublish fails with 403 ''OIDC permission denied for this action''.\npublishConfig.registry already pins the registry.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursor@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb001950310e49d2ef4f50f4cdf1da7215e65352","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changbaebang/unprovided/git/trees/eb001950310e49d2ef4f50f4cdf1da7215e65352"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changbaebang/unprovided/git/commits/000b72d70daef296496c6be1e126b4fd374e8536","verification":{"payload":"tree eb001950310e49d2ef4f50f4cdf1da7215e65352\nparent 2d62f6777f2a608f5e993a881d98ede35c87c34b\nauthor 방창배(changbae bang) <changbae.bang@29cm.co.kr> 1789623054 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789623054 +0900\n\nci: drop setup-node registry-url so npm performs the OIDC exchange (#14)\n\nWith registry-url set, setup-node writes an empty _authToken to .npmrc;\nnpm treats that as credentials and never exchanges the OIDC token, so\npublish fails with 403 ''OIDC permission denied for this action''.\npublishConfig.registry already pins the registry.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursor@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqq3sOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1VgQAAPXpf5IDRiSOxBsPYbX6cBn\n0af6CCH5dhBM3y0GyTrqPdDOawRHJmo2sjftHPVMfubZ89ykqiARIFolMnyMsK10\nNanJMtrwAxvNQM5I+be0jOIwp+V3AzR1PHgzT7XNq0zHifZ6c4ALXdJgeG