ic"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/a5bfafd76eaf83b48faa89e1086e44a51fba2066","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKGE1YmZhZmQ3NmVhZjgzYjQ4ZmFhODllMTA4NmU0NGE1MWZiYTIwNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/023d66e41047bd8df7ef2035ffdb799ea40bf933","sha":"023d66e41047bd8df7ef2035ffdb799ea40bf933","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/023d66e41047bd8df7ef2035ffdb799ea40bf933"}],"sha":"a5bfafd76eaf83b48faa89e1086e44a51fba2066","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/a5bfafd76eaf83b48faa89e1086e44a51fba2066"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/023d66e41047bd8df7ef2035ffdb799ea40bf933/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T12:03:17Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T12:03:37Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Make provider token budgets configurable, add model guidance, per-entry history delete\n\n- Ollama''s num_ctx and the OpenAI-compatible completion budget are now\n  Settings fields instead of a hardcoded 16384 - real reasoning models can\n  still exceed that default, so raising it needs to not require a release.\n- Settings panels for both providers now warn against reasoning/\"thinking\"\n  model variants for this single-turn JSON-extraction task and suggest\n  better-fit alternatives (qwen2.5-coder, Mistral-Small/Nemo, Phi-4).\n- History entries can now be deleted individually, not just cleared\n  entirely - bin/ai-template-maker-history gains a flock-guarded delete op,\n  and both analyze scripts now stamp every entry with an id.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b72bf734eee1016b4c51ffed97aee379ea39e795","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/b72bf734eee1016b4c51ffed97aee379ea39e795"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/023d66e41047bd8df7ef2035ffdb799ea40bf933","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/023d66e41047bd8df7ef2035ffdb799ea40bf933","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKDAyM2Q2NmU0MTA0N2JkOGRmN2VmMjAzNWZmZGI3OTllYTQwYmY5MzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/23c3f4c052e384ee3ca47d7c3e5da2faf45009c2","sha":"23c3f4c052e384ee3ca47d7c3e5da2faf45009c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/23c3f4c052e384ee3ca47d7c3e5da2faf45009c2"}],"sha":"023d66e41047bd8df7ef2035ffdb799ea40bf933","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/023d66e41047bd8df7ef2035ffdb799ea40bf933"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/23c3f4c052e384ee3ca47d7c3e5da2faf45009c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T08:41:25Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T08:41:25Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Release v0.1.23\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a2102160f6f7fe6cb08a169174e0b062cbfebaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/1a2102160f6f7fe6cb08a169174e0b062cbfebaa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/23c3f4c052e384ee3ca47d7c3e5da2faf45009c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/23c3f4c052e384ee3ca47d7c3e5da2faf45009c2","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKDIzYzNmNGMwNTJlMzg0ZWUzY2E0N2Q3YzNlNWRhMmZhZjQ1MDA5YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/96f756839b727776c9d1662da74e9764e19b1bef","sha":"96f756839b727776c9d1662da74e9764e19b1bef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/96f756839b727776c9d1662da74e9764e19b1bef"}],"sha":"23c3f4c052e384ee3ca47d7c3e5da2faf45009c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/23c3f4c052e384ee3ca47d7c3e5da2faf45009c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/96f756839b727776c9d1662da74e9764e19b1bef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T08:41:21Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T08:41:21Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Log every analysis to history, not just successes - with usage and runtime\n\nfail() - the single function every failure path in the script already\ngoes through - now calls log_history_failure before printing its error,\nso a failed analysis shows up in History too: whatever context was\nactually known at that point (repo/scope/provider/model, null for\nanything not yet resolved), the error message, and - if a provider\nrequest had already gone out - the token usage it reported even though\nthe request didn''t ultimately succeed.\n\n- Each call_<provider>() now extracts usage right after getting a\n  response (before any of that function''s own subsequent fail() calls),\n  normalized to {prompt_tokens, completion_tokens, total_tokens} across\n  all four providers'' different native field names (Anthropic''s\n  input/output_tokens, Gemini''s usageMetadata, Ollama''s prompt_eval_count/\n  eval_count, OpenAI''s usage.*).\n- start_time is captured as the very first thing the script does, so\n  every entry - success or failure - gets a duration_seconds.\n- The history-writing functions moved from near the bottom of the file\n  (where they were only ever called once, on success) to right after\n  HISTORY_FILE is resolved, since fail()''s very first real call now needs\n  them available.\n- HistoryList.vue shows a \"Failed\" chip + the error message, plus runtime\n  and token count when present - all individually v-if-guarded so\n  pre-existing history entries (which have none of these fields) render\n  exactly as before, no migration needed.\n\nVerified the core mechanism directly (not just syntax-checked): a very-\nearly failure with nothing set yet, a late failure with usage populated,\nand a success - no set -u crashes, correct field population in all three.\nUsage extraction verified against the exact token counts from an earlier\nreal reasoning-model failure (6630/8192/14822).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ed4e34f03d51723d22fa2f66dd56239f5b52536","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/0ed4e34f03d51723d22fa2f66dd56239f5b52536"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/96f756839b727776c9d1662da74e9764e19b1bef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/96f756839b727776c9d1662da74e9764e19b1bef","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKDk2Zjc1NjgzOWI3Mjc3NzZjOWQxNjYyZGE3NGU5NzY0ZTE5YjFiZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/acc50aed1ade99fbc44af1dab3623449e5a86034","sha":"acc50aed1ade99fbc44af1dab3623449e5a86034","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/acc50aed1ade99fbc44af1dab3623449e5a86034"}],"sha":"96f756839b727776c9d1662da74e9764e19b1bef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/96f756839b727776c9d1662da74e9764e19b1bef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/acc50aed1ade99fbc44af1dab3623449e5a86034/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T08:31:50Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T08:31:50Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Update default Gemini model: gemini-2.5-flash -> gemini-3.6-flash\n\ngemini-2.5-flash is no longer available to new API keys (confirmed via a\nreal \"Gemini API request failed\" -> now-diagnostic error from the\nprevious fix, which correctly surfaced Google''s actual rejection message\nthis time instead of a generic one). Updated the default everywhere it\nappears: settings.json, the script''s fallback, and the Settings tab''s\ndefault form value.\n\nExisting installs with a saved (now-stale) model value aren''t affected by\nthis default change - Settings'' \"Test connection\" dropdown already lists\nwhatever''s actually available to a given key, so switching is a Test +\npick-from-dropdown + Save rather than needing a code update.\n\nBumps to v0.1.22.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b12e47dc12ca85693af46339e502bfff8ab32bb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/b12e47dc12ca85693af46339e502bfff8ab32bb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/acc50aed1ade99fbc44af1dab3623449e5a86034","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/acc50aed1ade99fbc44af1dab3623449e5a86034","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKGFjYzUwYWVkMWFkZTk5ZmJjNDRhZjFkYWIzNjIzNDQ5ZTVhODYwMzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/5ff88661753c74215124ceb9ea9f09e5c6717b3b","sha":"5ff88661753c74215124ceb9ea9f09e5c6717b3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/5ff88661753c74215124ceb9ea9f09e5c6717b3b"}],"sha":"acc50aed1ade99fbc44af1dab3623449e5a86034","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/acc50aed1ade99fbc44af1dab3623449e5a86034"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/5ff88661753c74215124ceb9ea9f09e5c6717b3b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T08:25:41Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T08:25:41Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Fix opaque \"Gemini/Claude API request failed\" errors\n\nBoth call_anthropic() and call_gemini() were still on the original\ncurl -sf ... || fail \"<generic message>\" form from before the exit-code/\nHTTP-body capturing pattern existed (built out for call_ollama() and\ncall_openai() since). A real API-level failure - bad model name, quota\nexceeded, bad key - came through as a bare \"Gemini API request failed\" or\n\"Claude API request failed\" with zero indication of what actually went\nwrong, which is exactly what was just reported.\n\nBoth now match the other two providers: distinguish curl exit code (host\nunreachable) from an HTTP error status with the actual error.message body\nsurfaced directly. Verified against mocked 400/429 responses - both now\nreport the real cause instead of the generic message.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b533f04010bd331d2394cff6cd73d6c59535fc7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/b533f04010bd331d2394cff6cd73d6c59535fc7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/5ff88661753c74215124ceb9ea9f09e5c6717b3b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/5ff88661753c74215124ceb9ea9f09e5c6717b3b","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKDVmZjg4NjYxNzUzYzc0MjE1MTI0Y2ViOWVhOWYwOWU1YzY3MTdiM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/c0f310b53b2c5de3529d3c3b7ab8c5bc20da02aa","sha":"c0f310b53b2c5de3529d3c3b7ab8c5bc20da02aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/c0f310b53b2c5de3529d3c3b7ab8c5bc20da02aa"}],"sha":"5ff88661753c74215124ceb9ea9f09e5c6717b3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/5ff88661753c74215124ceb9ea9f09e5c6717b3b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/c0f310b53b2c5de3529d3c3b7ab8c5bc20da02aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T08:17:40Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T08:17:40Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Fix reasoning models silently failing on OpenAI-compatible servers\n\nReal failure from testing: a local reasoning model (Qwen3-family, served\nvia llama.cpp based on the response''s \"timings\" field) burned its entire\n8192-token budget writing to a separate \"reasoning_content\" field, hit\nfinish_reason:\"length\", and left \"content\" empty - which just produced a\ngeneric, unhelpful \"OpenAI-compatible server returned no content\".\n\n- call_openai() now checks for this specific signature (empty content +\n  finish_reason \"length\" + non-empty reasoning_content) and reports\n  exactly what happened instead of a generic failure.\n- Gives openai its own completion budget (openai_budget, default 16384,\n  separate from the shared $budget Anthropic/Gemini use) rather than the\n  8192 that was exhausted here - reasoning-capable models are common on\n  exactly the kind of local/self-hosted server this provider is also\n  meant to cover, and their reasoning traces alone can be substantial on\n  a prompt this size.\n\nVerified both against the user''s actual failure response (correctly\ndetected) and a normal successful response (unaffected, no false\npositive).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f169c9ddfbc47bc9b13bc074b7bfc5aebc6d765","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/3f169c9ddfbc47bc9b13bc074b7bfc5aebc6d765"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/c0f310b53b2c5de3529d3c3b7ab8c5bc20da02aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/c0f310b53b2c5de3529d3c3b7ab8c5bc20da02aa","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKGMwZjMxMGI1M2IyYzVkZTM1MjlkM2MzYjdhYjhjNWJjMjBkYTAyYWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/3028a6b7d1a4d92dcc50ec80c910132538086e66","sha":"3028a6b7d1a4d92dcc50ec80c910132538086e66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/3028a6b7d1a4d92dcc50ec80c910132538086e66"}],"sha":"c0f310b53b2c5de3529d3c3b7ab8c5bc20da02aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/c0f310b53b2c5de3529d3c3b7ab8c5bc20da02aa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/3028a6b7d1a4d92dcc50ec80c910132538086e66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T07:59:28Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T07:59:28Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Move history/job data off the USB boot device onto the storage pool\n\nMOS boots from a USB drive into RAM and only writes back to that same USB\nfor things meant to persist across reboots - limited write endurance,\nmeant for occasional config writes, not history.json (rewritten on every\nsingle analysis, and now holds full embedded results, making it bigger\nthan before) or the jobs/ directory (several small files per analysis,\npruned on every -start call).\n\nAll five scripts (ai-template-maker-analyze, -history, -analyze-start,\n-analyze-status, -analyze-cancel) now resolve their data directory\nagainst /boot/config/docker.json''s .appdata - the same real storage-pool\nlocation ai-template-maker-analyze''s own remap_appdata_paths() already\nresolves docker host paths against - falling back to the boot-resident\nplugin directory only if no pool is configured yet. settings.json stays\non the boot device, since MOS''s own plugin settings API controls that\npath directly and it''s only written on an explicit Save, not per\nanalysis.\n\nVerified the resolution logic against three cases: pool configured, no\npool configured, and docker.json missing entirely (first boot) - all\nresolve correctly, with the last two falling back safely rather than\nerroring.\n\nNote: existing history.json entries from before this change live at the\nold boot-resident path and won''t carry over - a clean cutover rather than\na migration, given this is still pre-1.0 with a small deployment.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e50d82c845d1873f17e691f667c6d66375c36f4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/e50d82c845d1873f17e691f667c6d66375c36f4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/3028a6b7d1a4d92dcc50ec80c910132538086e66","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/3028a6b7d1a4d92dcc50ec80c910132538086e66","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKDMwMjhhNmI3ZDFhNGQ5MmRjYzUwZWM4MGM5MTAxMzI1MzgwODZlNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/7f0010e4c4062cb7e514f8a293197828b4111986","sha":"7f0010e4c4062cb7e514f8a293197828b4111986","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/7f0010e4c4062cb7e514f8a293197828b4111986"}],"sha":"3028a6b7d1a4d92dcc50ec80c910132538086e66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/3028a6b7d1a4d92dcc50ec80c910132538086e66"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/7f0010e4c4062cb7e514f8a293197828b4111986/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T07:45:28Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T07:45:28Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Release v0.1.18\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e7cac2a1bbf5df837c3b49eeea723c19b73e718","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/4e7cac2a1bbf5df837c3b49eeea723c19b73e718"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/7f0010e4c4062cb7e514f8a293197828b4111986","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/7f0010e4c4062cb7e514f8a293197828b4111986","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKDdmMDAxMGU0YzQwNjJjYjdlNTE0ZjhhMjkzMTk3ODI4YjQxMTE5ODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/0de4c18f920217cc49c8f305a49fab8d0f0e8ef6","sha":"0de4c18f920217cc49c8f305a49fab8d0f0e8ef6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/0de4c18f920217cc49c8f305a49fab8d0f0e8ef6"}],"sha":"7f0010e4c4062cb7e514f8a293197828b4111986","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/7f0010e4c4062cb7e514f8a293197828b4111986"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/0de4c18f920217cc49c8f305a49fab8d0f0e8ef6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T07:45:23Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T07:45:23Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Add a fourth provider: OpenAI-compatible (cloud or self-hosted)\n\nRather than a strict \"OpenAI cloud API\" provider, this is generalized to\nany server speaking the same Chat Completions contract - a configurable\nbase_url (default https://api.openai.com/v1) is what makes it also work\nagainst LM Studio, vLLM''s OpenAI server, text-generation-webui, LocalAI,\nllama.cpp server mode, etc., the same way Ollama already covers local\nmodels via its own API. The API key is optional here (unlike\nAnthropic/Gemini), since most local OpenAI-compatible servers ignore it\nor accept any placeholder.\n\n- New bin/ai-template-maker-test-openai (mirrors -test-anthropic/-gemini):\n  verifies reachability and lists available models via GET <base_url>/\n  models. Verified against a mocked server for the with-key, no-key\n  (simulating a local server), and bad-key cases.\n- call_openai() in ai-template-maker-analyze resolves the configured model\n  against that same /models response before the real request - but softer\n  than Ollama''s hard-fail: falls back to the configured name verbatim on\n  any mismatch/hiccup, since \"OpenAI-compatible\" spans too many different\n  servers to trust every /models response as authoritative.\n- Settings gets an \"OpenAI-compatible\" panel: base URL field, optional API\n  key, Test connection, and a model dropdown populated from it - matching\n  the same pattern already in place for the other three providers.\n- Verified settings resolution end-to-end for the local-server/no-key\n  scenario specifically, since that''s the main new case this adds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4af569a3772d718256fec21322773cebd9ed792f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/4af569a3772d718256fec21322773cebd9ed792f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/0de4c18f920217cc49c8f305a49fab8d0f0e8ef6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/0de4c18f920217cc49c8f305a49fab8d0f0e8ef6","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKDBkZTRjMThmOTIwMjE3Y2M0OWM4ZjMwNWE0OWZhYjhkMGYwZThlZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/1b8de0a7ced7effec5556a1b1cdda75182ed6ed1","sha":"1b8de0a7ced7effec5556a1b1cdda75182ed6ed1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/1b8de0a7ced7effec5556a1b1cdda75182ed6ed1"}],"sha":"0de4c18f920217cc49c8f305a49fab8d0f0e8ef6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/0de4c18f920217cc49c8f305a49fab8d0f0e8ef6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/1b8de0a7ced7effec5556a1b1cdda75182ed6ed1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:47:23Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:47:23Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Release v0.1.17\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"99e0ba4d816601ab83a4cc0bda0bc4df13a4ccac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/99e0ba4d816601ab83a4cc0bda0bc4df13a4ccac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/1b8de0a7ced7effec5556a1b1cdda75182ed6ed1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/1b8de0a7ced7effec5556a1b1cdda75182ed6ed1","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKDFiOGRlMGE3Y2VkN2VmZmVjNTU1NmExYjFjZGRhNzUxODJlZDZlZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/de3bebd5d2811103d05985beb23d183cc3a95b8c","sha":"de3bebd5d2811103d05985beb23d183cc3a95b8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/de3bebd5d2811103d05985beb23d183cc3a95b8c"}],"sha":"1b8de0a7ced7effec5556a1b1cdda75182ed6ed1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/1b8de0a7ced7effec5556a1b1cdda75182ed6ed1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/de3bebd5d2811103d05985beb23d183cc3a95b8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:47:19Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:47:19Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Add six improvements: real cancel, longer waits, test connection for all\nproviders, compose port warnings, privileged warning, GitHub rate-limit\ndetection\n\n- Raised the client-side give-up ceiling for a running analysis from 10\n  minutes to 60 (Ollama on modest hardware was consistently exceeding\n  10). Correspondingly raised the job directory''s self-prune threshold\n  from 60 minutes to 6 hours, since a job with no intermediate writes to\n  its own directory for over an hour could otherwise have been pruned by\n  a second, unrelated analysis starting mid-run.\n- Cancel is now real: ai-template-maker-analyze-start launches the job\n  via setsid (its own process group) and records the PID; a new\n  ai-template-maker-analyze-cancel kills the whole group, not just the\n  top-level process, so nothing is left running/orphaned. Previously\n  Cancel only stopped the frontend from watching - the backend job kept\n  consuming resources until it finished on its own. Verified end-to-end:\n  process is actually killed, status correctly reports \"cancelled\".\n- Added ai-template-maker-test-anthropic and -test-gemini, mirroring\n  -test-ollama: verify the API key and list available models via each\n  provider''s own /v1/models-equivalent endpoint. All three providers''\n  Settings panels now have a \"Test connection\" button and a model\n  dropdown populated from it, instead of free-text model entry - closing\n  off the whole class of typo''d/mismatched model name bugs by\n  construction, the same way it already did for Ollama.\n- Port-conflict warnings now also apply to compose mode (previously\n  docker-only): a regex scan of the yaml for the plain \"HOST:CONTAINER\"\n  form this tool''s own schema always uses, cross-checked against the same\n  used-ports data as docker mode.\n- privileged:true now gets a pointed red alert next to the switch,\n  distinct from the general \"use at your own risk\" disclaimer.\n- GitHub''s unauthenticated rate limit (403/429) is now detected and\n  reported explicitly, pointing at the optional GitHub token in Settings\n  - previously it was misreported as a flat \"repo not found\", sending\n  people looking for a URL typo instead of the actual fix. Verified\n  against mocked rate-limit and genuine-404 responses to confirm they''re\n  distinguished correctly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0a5ffedd0370ee96a461e9db0efad4e816bcba7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/d0a5ffedd0370ee96a461e9db0efad4e816bcba7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/de3bebd5d2811103d05985beb23d183cc3a95b8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/de3bebd5d2811103d05985beb23d183cc3a95b8c","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKGRlM2JlYmQ1ZDI4MTExMDNkMDU5ODViZWIyM2QxODNjYzNhOTViOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/2457ec09fbee2ab8128b8616e80aec6bd9efad81","sha":"2457ec09fbee2ab8128b8616e80aec6bd9efad81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/2457ec09fbee2ab8128b8616e80aec6bd9efad81"}],"sha":"de3bebd5d2811103d05985beb23d183cc3a95b8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/de3bebd5d2811103d05985beb23d183cc3a95b8c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/2457ec09fbee2ab8128b8616e80aec6bd9efad81/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:18:58Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:18:58Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Fix Ollama model-tag mismatch between Settings test and real generation\n\ncurl exit 22 (HTTP error response) on the real generation request, right\nafter a passing preflight/Settings test, pointed at Ollama itself\nrejecting the request rather than a reachability problem. Root cause: the\nSettings tab''s \"Test connection\" does lenient exact-or-prefix matching\n(a configured \"qwen2.5-coder\" counts as found against a pulled\n\"qwen2.5-coder:7b\"), but Ollama''s real /api/chat endpoint needs an exact\ntag - a bare name only resolves if a \":latest\" tag happens to exist. A\nconfig that passed the test could still get a bare 404 at generation\ntime, with no detail surfaced (curl -f discards the response body).\n\ncall_ollama() now resolves the configured model against the same\n/api/tags response used for the reachability check, using identical\nmatching to the test script, and uses the resolved exact tag in the real\nrequest - so anything that passes the Settings test is guaranteed to\nwork here too. A genuine mismatch now fails immediately with the actual\npulled-model list, instead of a bare curl exit code after a full\ngeneration attempt. Also switched the generation request off curl -f so\na non-200 response''s body (Ollama returns {\"error\":\"...\"} on failure) is\nsurfaced directly rather than discarded.\n\nVerified end-to-end against a mock Ollama server that enforces exact\ntags: a bare model name now resolves and succeeds; a genuinely unpulled\nmodel fails early with a clear message.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"540db871d1ceb01d7d61a0221f389f35d1a4b335","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/540db871d1ceb01d7d61a0221f389f35d1a4b335"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/2457ec09fbee2ab8128b8616e80aec6bd9efad81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/2457ec09fbee2ab8128b8616e80aec6bd9efad81","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKDI0NTdlYzA5ZmJlZTJhYjgxMjhiODYxNmU4MGFlYzZiZDllZmFkODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/f6f5fcb4ae76a6f8e35c49585204f90650d77716","sha":"f6f5fcb4ae76a6f8e35c49585204f90650d77716","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/f6f5fcb4ae76a6f8e35c49585204f90650d77716"}],"sha":"2457ec09fbee2ab8128b8616e80aec6bd9efad81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/2457ec09fbee2ab8128b8616e80aec6bd9efad81"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/f6f5fcb4ae76a6f8e35c49585204f90650d77716/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:14:17Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:14:17Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Release v0.1.15\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3ae17554fccc54fc48de48fdaf806a0ecff6b105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/3ae17554fccc54fc48de48fdaf806a0ecff6b105"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/f6f5fcb4ae76a6f8e35c49585204f90650d77716","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/f6f5fcb4ae76a6f8e35c49585204f90650d77716","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKGY2ZjVmY2I0YWU3NmE2ZjhlMzVjNDk1ODUyMDRmOTA2NTBkNzc3MTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/b6edfa65f659ada02904db6d937655b806715497","sha":"b6edfa65f659ada02904db6d937655b806715497","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/b6edfa65f659ada02904db6d937655b806715497"}],"sha":"f6f5fcb4ae76a6f8e35c49585204f90650d77716","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/f6f5fcb4ae76a6f8e35c49585204f90650d77716"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/b6edfa65f659ada02904db6d937655b806715497/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:14:13Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:14:13Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Trim Ollama host/model whitespace end-to-end; make curl failures diagnostic\n\n- Settings'' Test connection and Save now trim every text field before\n  use/persisting - a stray leading/trailing space (easy via copy-paste)\n  was silently breaking the exact/prefix match against Ollama''s pulled-\n  model list even when the model was actually there. Both\n  ai-template-maker-analyze and ai-template-maker-test-ollama also trim\n  defensively on read, regardless of caller.\n- Both scripts'' curl failures were a single blanket \"Could not reach\n  Ollama...\" message regardless of *why* - connection refused, timeout,\n  TLS error, etc. all looked identical, and worse, ai-template-maker-\n  analyze used byte-identical wording for both its preflight check and\n  the real generation request, so a report of that exact message couldn''t\n  even say which one had failed. Now every curl failure path captures the\n  actual exit code and stderr detail, and the preflight/generation-request\n  messages are worded distinctly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4f05bbc9a18519cb8d6e91323fd37ab5acff8676","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/4f05bbc9a18519cb8d6e91323fd37ab5acff8676"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/b6edfa65f659ada02904db6d937655b806715497","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","