"AzAel76"},"message":"Release v0.1.12\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9eb6aa235cdbcf556790ed6923884665167fa0eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/9eb6aa235cdbcf556790ed6923884665167fa0eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/b3172ca47abb4b2bd1598c86ed2f2911187d1d6c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/b3172ca47abb4b2bd1598c86ed2f2911187d1d6c","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKGIzMTcyY2E0N2FiYjRiMmJkMTU5OGM4NmVkMmYyOTExMTg3ZDFkNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/48968bc841456383d065d9d1d03bb1260dd18492","sha":"48968bc841456383d065d9d1d03bb1260dd18492","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/48968bc841456383d065d9d1d03bb1260dd18492"}],"sha":"b3172ca47abb4b2bd1598c86ed2f2911187d1d6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/b3172ca47abb4b2bd1598c86ed2f2911187d1d6c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/48968bc841456383d065d9d1d03bb1260dd18492/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T05:12:13Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T05:12:13Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Fix URL parsing bugs, reduce port hallucination, add port-conflict warning\n\nFound analyzing https://github.com/Pelski/ytzero?ref=selfh.st (a selfh.st\nreferral link):\n\n- A trailing \"?ref=selfh.st\" had no \"/\" to stop the owner/repo regex''s\n  repo-name capture at, so the whole query string got swallowed into what\n  the script thought was the repo name - leaking into the docker/stack\n  name, the OCI source label, and the history entry.\n- While fixing that, found the same regex''s \".git\" stripping was also\n  broken: sed -E is POSIX extended regex, which has no lazy/non-greedy\n  quantifier, so \"[^/]+?(\\.git)?/?$\" never actually made \".git\" optional\n  the way it looked like it should - confirmed \"owner/repo.git\" was\n  passing straight through unstripped.\n- Both fixed by stripping query string/fragment/trailing-slash/.git via\n  plain bash parameter expansion before a simplified regex, rather than\n  trying to encode all of that into one clever pattern.\n\nAlso: the model used port 3000 for ytzero when the repo''s Dockerfile\n(EXPOSE 3001, ENV PORT=3001), docker-compose.yml (\"3001:3001\"), and\nREADME all say 3001 - a framework-default-port assumption overriding the\nactual evidence. Strengthened the prompt rule to name this failure mode\nexplicitly.\n\nAdded: the install dialog now flags a docker-mode port whose host value\nmatches a port already bound by another container, using the same\nGET /docker/mos/ports endpoint the native dialogs'' \"Inspect\" panel uses -\nwarns, doesn''t auto-change, so the user keeps final say.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"399af269768b35f0dadddc57dbc31a4c831fe7e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/399af269768b35f0dadddc57dbc31a4c831fe7e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/48968bc841456383d065d9d1d03bb1260dd18492","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/48968bc841456383d065d9d1d03bb1260dd18492","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKDQ4OTY4YmM4NDE0NTYzODNkMDY1ZDlkMWQwM2JiMTI2MGRkMTg0OTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/7f30df5c3ce1f9a736426e3117ec94525bf24697","sha":"7f30df5c3ce1f9a736426e3117ec94525bf24697","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/7f30df5c3ce1f9a736426e3117ec94525bf24697"}],"sha":"48968bc841456383d065d9d1d03bb1260dd18492","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/48968bc841456383d065d9d1d03bb1260dd18492"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/7f30df5c3ce1f9a736426e3117ec94525bf24697/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T04:29:42Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T04:29:42Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Release v0.1.11\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"578193c301bcd029b0c7cfff2b07af5a11318c88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/578193c301bcd029b0c7cfff2b07af5a11318c88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/7f30df5c3ce1f9a736426e3117ec94525bf24697","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/7f30df5c3ce1f9a736426e3117ec94525bf24697","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKDdmMzBkZjVjM2NlMWY5YTczNjQyNmUzMTE3ZWM5NDUyNWJmMjQ2OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/812e8b1559e8db966671a0ddc2b4dcb5310740e8","sha":"812e8b1559e8db966671a0ddc2b4dcb5310740e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/812e8b1559e8db966671a0ddc2b4dcb5310740e8"}],"sha":"7f30df5c3ce1f9a736426e3117ec94525bf24697","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/7f30df5c3ce1f9a736426e3117ec94525bf24697"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/812e8b1559e8db966671a0ddc2b4dcb5310740e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T04:29:30Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T04:29:30Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Fix \"Analyzing\" banner always naming Ollama regardless of provider\n\nIt was a static string, unconditionally mentioning \"a local Ollama model\"\nduring every analysis, no matter which provider was actually configured -\nso switching back to Anthropic/Gemini in Settings looked like it hadn''t\ntaken effect, since the banner never changed to say so.\n\nNow re-fetches the current provider setting fresh at the start of every\nrun (not cached from mount - the Analyze and Settings tabs share an\nalways-mounted component tree via v-window, so a provider switch made\nafter the plugin first loaded wouldn''t otherwise be reflected here even\nthough the backend script itself always reads current settings.json\nregardless) and names it directly: \"Analyzing with Anthropic (Claude)...\",\n\"...Google Gemini...\", \"...Ollama (local)...\". The \"can take several\nminutes\" hint now only shows when Ollama is actually the active provider.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"064c21e2f1b25b4090db54f5d668236f52308746","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/064c21e2f1b25b4090db54f5d668236f52308746"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/812e8b1559e8db966671a0ddc2b4dcb5310740e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/812e8b1559e8db966671a0ddc2b4dcb5310740e8","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKDgxMmU4YjE1NTllOGRiOTY2NjcxYTBkZGMyYjRkY2I1MzEwNzQwZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/d29f9ff11e02bf8fc2c6003fbf74d791a8cbb488","sha":"d29f9ff11e02bf8fc2c6003fbf74d791a8cbb488","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/d29f9ff11e02bf8fc2c6003fbf74d791a8cbb488"}],"sha":"812e8b1559e8db966671a0ddc2b4dcb5310740e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/812e8b1559e8db966671a0ddc2b4dcb5310740e8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/d29f9ff11e02bf8fc2c6003fbf74d791a8cbb488/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T03:57:05Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T03:57:05Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Release v0.1.10\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e9111570fa925660e99780f5f2c8f238d637b200","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/e9111570fa925660e99780f5f2c8f238d637b200"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/d29f9ff11e02bf8fc2c6003fbf74d791a8cbb488","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/d29f9ff11e02bf8fc2c6003fbf74d791a8cbb488","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKGQyOWY5ZmYxMWUwMmJmOGZjMmM2MDAzZmJmNzRkNzkxYThjYmI0ODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/ca2229cb37035209c227db4aded82f3ce9fcda05","sha":"ca2229cb37035209c227db4aded82f3ce9fcda05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/ca2229cb37035209c227db4aded82f3ce9fcda05"}],"sha":"d29f9ff11e02bf8fc2c6003fbf74d791a8cbb488","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/d29f9ff11e02bf8fc2c6003fbf74d791a8cbb488"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/ca2229cb37035209c227db4aded82f3ce9fcda05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T03:56:54Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T03:56:54Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Fix Ollama analyses hitting MOS''s 60s query timeout ceiling\n\nMOS clamps /mos/plugins/query to a 60-second timeout both client- and\nserver-side, with no way to raise it, and its only other execution\nprimitive (/mos/plugins/executefunction) is fire-and-forget with no way\nto return a result. A modest local Ollama model with no GPU can easily\ntake longer than that to produce a whole template.\n\nFix: split into a background-job + polling flow instead of one\nsynchronous call.\n\n- bin/ai-template-maker-analyze-start launches the existing, unchanged\n  ai-template-maker-analyze as a detached background process and returns\n  a job id almost instantly (its own stdin/stdout/stderr are redirected\n  away first, since MOS''s query executor otherwise waits for those file\n  descriptors to close, not just the foreground process to exit).\n- bin/ai-template-maker-analyze-status reports {status: running|done|\n  error} for a job id, reading a status file under\n  /boot/optional/plugins/ai-template-maker/jobs/<job-id>/ (self-pruned\n  after an hour). Rejects any job id not matching the exact format\n  analyze-start generates, since it''s the only thing standing between a\n  caller-supplied string and a path built from it.\n- mosClient.analyzeRepo now starts a job and polls every 2.5s (10 minute\n  give-up ceiling, cancellable) instead of making one 60s-capped request.\n- AnalyzeForm shows elapsed time during the wait and a Cancel button.\n\nVerified locally end-to-end with a mocked slow analyze binary: instant\nreturn from -start, correct running->done transition, crash/error\nsurfacing, and rejection of a path-traversal job id.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b1aa4b07045204afdff262c2232952fada43e0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/3b1aa4b07045204afdff262c2232952fada43e0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/ca2229cb37035209c227db4aded82f3ce9fcda05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/ca2229cb37035209c227db4aded82f3ce9fcda05","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKGNhMjIyOWNiMzcwMzUyMDljMjI3ZGI0YWRlZDgyZjNjZTlmY2RhMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/a3b27ee6461ebe0d01463e881bc34c149add756f","sha":"a3b27ee6461ebe0d01463e881bc34c149add756f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/a3b27ee6461ebe0d01463e881bc34c149add756f"}],"sha":"ca2229cb37035209c227db4aded82f3ce9fcda05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/ca2229cb37035209c227db4aded82f3ce9fcda05"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/a3b27ee6461ebe0d01463e881bc34c149add756f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T03:27:52Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T03:27:52Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Release v0.1.9\n\nAlso fixes the plugin manifest''s description (shown in MOS''s plugin\nlisting), which still said \"using Claude\" - now \"using AI\" since\nAnthropic is one of three supported providers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"755245b54e396359655055d47b6e23f82e5aa3fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/755245b54e396359655055d47b6e23f82e5aa3fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/a3b27ee6461ebe0d01463e881bc34c149add756f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/a3b27ee6461ebe0d01463e881bc34c149add756f","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKGEzYjI3ZWU2NDYxZWJlMGQwMTQ2M2U4ODFiYzM0YzE0OWFkZDc1NmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/0b551136dbce5ff3e61ade5e39e2b269ef04a2f1","sha":"0b551136dbce5ff3e61ade5e39e2b269ef04a2f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/0b551136dbce5ff3e61ade5e39e2b269ef04a2f1"}],"sha":"a3b27ee6461ebe0d01463e881bc34c149add756f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/a3b27ee6461ebe0d01463e881bc34c149add756f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/0b551136dbce5ff3e61ade5e39e2b269ef04a2f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T03:27:40Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T03:27:40Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Fix provider-specific wording now that Anthropic isn''t the only option\n\n- Analyze tab''s description no longer names Claude specifically now that\n  Gemini and Ollama are also supported providers.\n- Fix a real bug, not just wording: the shared JSON-validation failure\n  after the provider dispatch always said \"Claude did not return valid\n  JSON\" regardless of which provider actually ran - a Gemini or Ollama\n  failure would misreport as a Claude failure. Now names the actual\n  configured provider.\n- Generalize two code comments describing provider-agnostic logic that\n  still said \"Claude\".\n\nLeft alone: SettingsForm''s \"Anthropic (Claude)\" labels and Claude-vs-Gemini\ncomparison (correctly provider-specific), and error messages inside\ncall_anthropic() itself (only ever run on that code path).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"98407809000ee4372f4d591eb7660a3d9ffce5ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/98407809000ee4372f4d591eb7660a3d9ffce5ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/0b551136dbce5ff3e61ade5e39e2b269ef04a2f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"htt