","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/da6a165513072e40a2eaae097daec49dd69176e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T01:43:37Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T01:43:37Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Release v0.1.6\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2c354fa602995af5a0c3332e8611ae72cdfa61f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/a2c354fa602995af5a0c3332e8611ae72cdfa61f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/da6a165513072e40a2eaae097daec49dd69176e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/da6a165513072e40a2eaae097daec49dd69176e2","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKGRhNmExNjU1MTMwNzJlNDBhMmVhYWUwOTdkYWVjNDlkZDY5MTc2ZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/555d8d37f5aaaa246e94bbd0ef24e571fec3229c","sha":"555d8d37f5aaaa246e94bbd0ef24e571fec3229c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/555d8d37f5aaaa246e94bbd0ef24e571fec3229c"}],"sha":"da6a165513072e40a2eaae097daec49dd69176e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/da6a165513072e40a2eaae097daec49dd69176e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/555d8d37f5aaaa246e94bbd0ef24e571fec3229c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T01:43:27Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T01:43:27Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Default to required-only scope; multi-provider settings; analysis history\n\n- Flip the analyze form''s default template scope to \"required only\"\n  (was \"all settings\"); the toggle now lists it first.\n- Rework the Settings tab to configure all three providers independently\n  (settings.json: {provider, anthropic:{...}, gemini:{...}, ollama:{...}})\n  with a \"Default AI provider\" selector, so switching providers doesn''t\n  clobber the other providers'' saved keys. Each provider panel now has a\n  cost/reliability/speed disclaimer and brief setup steps.\n- Add a History tab: the analyze script appends {repo, url, mode, scope,\n  analyzed_at} to a history.json on the host after each successful\n  analysis (flock-guarded, capped at 100 entries, best-effort), and a new\n  bin/ai-template-maker-history script serves/clears it for the UI. Each\n  entry has an \"open repository\" button that opens it in a new tab.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa9670fe9ff59700d72e7873ee471bef708bd6c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/aa9670fe9ff59700d72e7873ee471bef708bd6c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/555d8d37f5aaaa246e94bbd0ef24e571fec3229c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":f