"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/da17ed65bab2d62151a0e3f4dee0a24089987ebe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T02:08:42Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T02:08:42Z","email":"williamsoncs76@gmail.com","name":"AzAel76"},"message":"Fix repo fetch bugs found by testing against a real edge-case repo, codify comprehensive-template intent\n\nTesting against iamspido/github-release-monitor (docker run + --env-file,\nnested Dockerfile/compose/.env, a 45KB README) exposed two bugs: the\ntruncation budget cut off before reaching the actual docker run/.env docs,\nand root-only file discovery missed nested Dockerfile/compose/.env files\nentirely. Switched to the recursive git tree API with a generous\ntruncation budget, and added explicit .env/.env.example handling as the\nauthoritative variable source when a docker run uses --env-file.\n\nAlso made explicit in the prompt that generated templates should include\nevery variable found (not a \"required only\" subset) - the goal is a\ntemplate the user only ever needs to delete from, never add to.\n\nsamples/analyzed/github-release-monitor.json is the resulting template\nfrom that test run, kept as a fixture/reference.","tree":{"sha":"539576f4a7a360424fbf4a1e2070e64fb89badfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/trees/539576f4a7a360424fbf4a1e2070e64fb89badfa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/git/commits/da17ed65bab2d62151a0e3f4dee0a24089987ebe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76","id":52898113,"login":"AzAel76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODk4MTEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/da17ed65bab2d62151a0e3f4dee0a24089987ebe","node_id":"C_kwDOUbqea9oAKGRhMTdlZDY1YmFiMmQ2MjE1MWEwZTNmNGRlZTBhMjQwODk5ODdlYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commit/76c4b373f3c146b799150edaaa78d5bbe50c925d","sha":"76c4b373f3c146b799150edaaa78d5bbe50c925d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/76c4b373f3c146b799150edaaa78d5bbe50c925d"}],"sha":"da17ed65bab2d62151a0e3f4dee0a24089987ebe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AzAel76/mos-docker-template-maker/commits/da17ed65bab2d62151a0e3f4dee0a24089987ebe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52898113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAel76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzAe