:"Jakub"},"message":"Minimal repro: provide-shared module in an expose''s sync graph empties js.sync\n\nBuilding the same expose three ways shows that a ProvideSharedPlugin entry for a\nmodule reachable through the expose''s synchronous graph makes the Rspack-native\nModule Federation manifest report exposes[...].js.sync as [].\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e4b87005e5d237b159347d26fdd5646582ead351","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaknas/rspack-mf-provide-shared-sync-repro/git/trees/e4b87005e5d237b159347d26fdd5646582ead351"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaknas/rspack-mf-provide-shared-sync-repro/git/commits/dacd8bf0cb62d63e48e237240d1f25c5242314a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36169811?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaknas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaknas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaknas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaknas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jaknas","id":36169811,"login":"jaknas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTY5ODEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaknas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaknas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaknas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaknas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaknas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaknas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jaknas/rspack-mf-provide-shared-sync-repro/commit/dacd8bf0cb62d63e48e237240d1f25c5242314a7","node_id":"C_kwDOUbwhJ9oAKGRhY2Q4YmYwY2I2MmQ2M2U0OGUyMzcyNDBkMWYyNWM1MjQyMzE0YTc","parents":[],"sha":"dacd8bf0cb62d63e48e237240d1f25c524231