mpletes the frontend wiring:\n\nDOM cache: 12 new element references (btnLiveOrgSync, realityDiff*,\n  decisionInbox*, passportsGrid, btnViewRealityDiff, etc.)\n\nEvent listeners: Live Org Sync, Reality Diff view toggle, Reconcile\n  Diff, Refresh Decisions — all bound with proper view switching\n\nloadWarRoomData() now calls: loadDecisionInbox(), loadTrustPassports(),\n  loadRealityDiff(), loadEGACStatus() after initial data fetch\n\nNew functions:\n  syncLiveOrg()      — POST /api/org/sync, update HUD repo count\n  loadRealityDiff()  — GET /api/ontology/reality-diff, render drift table\n  loadDecisionInbox() — GET /api/ontology/decisions, render decision cards\n  resolveDecision()  — POST /api/ontology/decisions/:id/action\n  loadTrustPassports() — GET /api/ontology/trust-passports, render L1-L4 cards\n  loadEGACStatus()   — GET /api/egac/status, log to terminal\n\nView toggle updated: btnViewRealityDiff hides mesh/grid, shows diff panel.\nbtnViewGraph and btnViewGrid now also hide the diff panel.\n\nAll tests green: 21/21 acceptance, 8/8 self-check, 10/10 EGAC proof.\n\nGenerated by Mistral Vibe.\nCo-Authored-By: Mistral Vibe <vibe@mistral.ai>","tree":{"sha":"0e1adfcd96e6e240bad61d7516c968f707007f7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aftergraph/war-room/git/trees/0e1adfcd96e6e240bad61d7516c968f707007f7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aftergraph/war-room/git/commits/31147988702809c11905a51dcaff18036ad87620","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147070826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonasAbde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonasAbde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonasAbde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonasAbde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JonasAbde","id":147070826,"login":"