i.github.com/users/JonasAbde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aftergraph/war-room/commits/fdfa41233bc3790bbcf25350811e686ee01eede8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T19:38:58Z","email":"empire1266@gmail.com","name":"Jonas ABde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T19:38:58Z","email":"empire1266@gmail.com","name":"Jonas ABde"},"message":"feat(war-room): live org sync, reality diff UI, decision inbox, trust passports\n\nIntegrates pending working-tree changes into the EGAC commit lineage:\n\nGitHub adapter (integrations/github/src/adapter.js, +218 lines):\n- resolveToken() auto-discovers GitHub token from env or gh CLI\n- fetchGovernanceOrgState() pulls latest-org-state.json from\n  Aftergraph/after-graph-governance for canonical contract comparison\n- syncLiveOrg() enriches 31 repos with live HEAD SHAs, open PRs,\n  and contract roles from the governance registry\n- classifyGovernance expanded with 15 additional governed repos\n- inferRole/inferPlane helpers for dynamic repo classification\n\nState projector (services/projection/src/projector.js, +30 lines):\n- updateRepositories() merges live GitHub discovery into read models\n- inferPlane() maps repo names to architecture planes\n\nOperator cockpit (index.html, +75 lines):\n- Live org sync button in header telemetry bar\n- Reality Diff view tab (Palantir AIP Expected vs Observed)\n- Decision Inbox card with governed action substrate\n- Agent Trust Passports grid (L1-L4 autonomy frontier)\n- Repo count updated from 28+2 to 31 live governed\n\nAll tests green: 21/21 acceptance, 8/8 self-check, 10/10 EGAC proof.\n\nGenerated by Mistral Vibe.\nCo-Authored-By: Mistral Vibe <vibe@mistral.ai>","tree":{"sha":"d401d7bdb5223750e63adbf50464aa74c6f6b525","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aftergraph/war-room/git/trees/d401d7bdb5223750e63adbf50464aa74c6f6b525"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aftergraph/war-room/git/commits/fdfa41233bc3790bbcf25350811e686e