thub.com/users/JonasAbde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JonasAbde","id":147070826,"login":"JonasAbde","node_id":"U_kgDOCMQfag","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonasAbde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonasAbde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonasAbde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonasAbde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonasAbde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonasAbde","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aftergraph/war-room/commits/a43f3494755050f7c69f7b04150ed7b275500cf6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T19:37:05Z","email":"empire1266@gmail.com","name":"Jonas ABde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T19:37:05Z","email":"empire1266@gmail.com","name":"Jonas ABde"},"message":"feat(egac): Evidence-Gated Autonomy Controller with provable FCR bound\n\nReplaces heuristic BayesianRiskEngine with EGAC — a mathematically\ngrounded algorithm based on the VAIE research program and MISSION-Bench\nSTUDY-008 empirical results (275 runs, 7 conditions, 3 models).\n\nKey contributions:\n- Sequential Bayesian update with empirically estimated sensitivity/specificity\n  per evidence tier (tier_0 self-assertion through tier_6 human approval)\n- Provably correct FCR upper bound: FCR <= Product(1 - sensitivity_t_i)\n  FCR = 0 for tier_2 (deterministic) evidence — fail-closed by construction\n- Cost-asymmetry autonomy decision: alpha = C_FN / (C_FP + C_FN)\n  Self-assertion (tier_0) never permits AUTONOMOUS_EXECUTION\n- Wilson score CI on sensitivity estimates with Hoeffding sample complexity\n- Online calibration store for continuous sensitivity refinement\n- Validated against STUDY-008: baseline FCR=56%, evidence-gated FCR=0%\n  VSR improvement A->G: +40 percentage points\n\nAPI endpoints:\n- GET  /api/egac/status     — engine config, tiers, priors, calibration\n- GET  /api/egac/fcr        — FCR bound for given tiers\n- POST /api/egac/decide     — autonomy decision for repo + evidence chain\n- POST /api/egac/calibrate  — online calibration recording\n\nTests: 10/10 EGAC proof suite, 5/5 MISSION-Bench validation,\n21/21 acceptance suite, 8/8 self-check — all green.\n\nGenerated by Mistral Vibe.\nCo-Authored-By: Mistral Vibe <vibe@mistral.ai>","tree":{"sha":"3903f932e72155f614e6195b4c8ba76c5620d39b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aftergraph/war-room/git/trees/3903f932e72155f614e6195b4c8ba76c5620d39b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aftergraph/war-room/git/commits/a43f3494755050f7c69f7b04150ed7b275500cf6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147070826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonasAbde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonasAbde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonasAbde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonasAbde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JonasAbde","id":147070826,"login":"JonasAbde","node_id":"U_kgDOCMQfag","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonasAbde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonasAbde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonasAbde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonasAbde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonasAbde/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonasAbde","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Aftergraph/war-room/commit/a43f3494755050f7c69f7b04150ed7b275500cf6","node_id":"C_kwDOUcU2ONoAKGE0M2YzNDk0NzU1MDUwZjdjNjlmN2IwNDE1MGVkN2IyNzU1MDBjZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://g