"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:41:22.631Z","repositoryId":1372083894,"sha":"292941d9c72c6e930c2ebe83326250325a119acb"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"mahdiporkar","providerType":"User"},"email":"Mahdiporkar@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi"},"authoredDate":"2026-09-16T22:09:26Z","committedDate":"2026-09-16T22:09:26Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"mahdiporkar","providerType":"User"},"email":"Mahdiporkar@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:41:22.631Z","repositoryId":1372083894,"sha":"dc75e04259e2620c81a26255f8dd89c3f153cb80"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"devShaparak","providerType":"User"},"email":"m.porkar@shaparak.com","name":"mahdi"},"authoredDate":"2026-09-16T14:58:13Z","committedDate":"2026-09-16T14:58:13Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"devShaparak","providerType":"User"},"email":"m.porkar@shaparak.com","name":"mahdi"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:41:22.631Z","repositoryId":1372083894,"sha":"8b5e582e6dab7ff01a4598245f598446104c9cd8"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"pariya78","providerType":"User"},"email":"pariya.agahi@gmail.com","name":"pariya78"},"authoredDate":"2026-09-16T14:34:07Z","committedDate":"2026-09-16T14:34:07Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:41:22.631Z","repositoryId":1372083894,"sha":"699f2a7cd6dc75dc08abb9d6a60d0e1080659811"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"mahdiporkar","providerType":"User"},"email":"Mahdiporkar@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi"},"authoredDate":"2026-09-15T20:34:43Z","committedDate":"2026-09-15T20:34:43Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"mahdiporkar","providerType":"User"},"email":"Mahdiporkar@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:41:22.631Z","repositoryId":1372083894,"sha":"abf5cabaff22e7940b969d0e0e76cf6e3d745a51"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:41:22.631Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17072984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mahdiporkar","id":17072984,"login":"mahdiporkar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDcyOTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/commits/4bdd8b89bb8c53193a4c486afe30c03eab35b5d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T03:33:27Z","email":"mahdiporkar@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Porkar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T03:33:27Z","email":"mahdiporkar@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Porkar"},"message":"Reorganize the admin panel into topic-based pages with tabs\n\nThe control panel published one side-menu entry per operation, so a single\nroute configuration walked the administrator through six unrelated sidebar\nitems. The sidebar now lists seven administrative domains and each domain''s\noperations are tabs on one page.\n\nDomains and their tab order follow the real configuration workflow rather\nthan the alphabet: a service target exists before the route pointing at it,\na route before its operations, a connection before the auth profile that\nuses it and the test lab that exercises it; a Superset instance before its\nassets and grants.\n\n  راهنما · دسترسی سازمانی و مجوزها · کاربران و نقش‌ها · میکروفرانت‌ها\n  مسیرها و اتصال‌ها · گزارش‌ها · پایش و حسابرسی\n\n- No page and no permission was removed. All 19 pages stay separate routes\n  with their own requiredResource/requiredAction, so the effective catalog\n  still filters one tab at a time and a restricted administrator only ever\n  sees the tabs it holds. Landing on a domain redirects to the first tab\n  that subject may open; no default tab is hardcoded.\n- Tabs are navigation, not local state: every tab is its own URL, so\n  refresh, Back/Forward and bookmarks work, and the Shell highlights the\n  parent domain because each domain publishes a landing route.\n- Renamed URLs stay published as redirect-only routes carrying their\n  destination''s exact permission. The Shell mounts a micro frontend only on\n  a published route, so a legacy path has to remain in the catalog for its\n  redirect to run at all.\n- AdminTabbedPage holds the one header and tab strip, free of domain logic.\n- V83 publishes the canonical 0.7.0 ADMIN manifest: 19 pages, 5 domain\n  landing routes and 16 legacy redirects.\n\nThis reverses an earlier decision, encoded in admin-governance''s \"does not\nrender tab navigation\" guard, that admin navigation must live entirely in\nthe Shell side menu. That guard is replaced by assertions for the new\ncontract; its two stale ADMIN 0.5.0/18-page checks, failing since V79, now\ntrack the shipped manifest.\n\nVerified in Chrome against the running stack: 29/29 checks covering sidebar\ncontents, default tab, tab-click URL changes, refresh, Back, every legacy\nredirect and every page still rendering.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e35a12e0d2eec5dbabdb008b7fff6bd6d3561713","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/git/trees/e35a12e0d2eec5dbabdb008b7fff6bd6d3561713"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/git/commits/4bdd8b89bb8c53193a4c486afe30c03eab35b5d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17072984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mahdiporkar","id":17072984,"login":"mahdiporkar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDcyOTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/commit/4bdd8b89bb8c53193a4c486afe30c03eab35b5d9","node_id":"C_kwDOUchWttoAKDRiZGQ4Yjg5YmI4YzUzMTkzYTRjNDg2YWZlMzBjMDNlYWIzNWI1ZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/commit/c4e573342eaa4f3ee9745ca53c6e22c1fd56b53b","sha":"c4e573342eaa4f3ee9745ca53c6e22c1fd56b53b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/commits/c4e573342eaa4f3ee9745ca53c6e22c1fd56b53b"}],"sha":"4bdd8b89bb8c53193a4c486afe30c03eab35b5d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/commits/4bdd8b89bb8c53193a4c486afe30c03eab35b5d9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17072984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mahdiporkar","id":17072984,"login":"mahdiporkar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDcyOTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/commits/c4e573342eaa4f3ee9745ca53c6e22c1fd56b53b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T03:10:18Z","email":"mahdiporkar@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Porkar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T03:10:18Z","email":"mahdiporkar@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Porkar"},"message":"Display Superset reports inside Aurevia instead of a new browser tab\n\nThe Reports micro frontend opened dashboards with an anchor carrying\ntarget=\"_blank\", so selecting a report left the Super App entirely. The\ncatalog now opens a report in place and the Shell stays visible.\n\n- Split the MFE into ReportsCatalog (cards, search) and ReportViewer,\n  which embeds the BFF''s validated same-origin url_path in an iframe and\n  sizes it from the measured container offset rather than a fixed height.\n- Viewer state is a real URL, /reports/view/<assetId>, derived from the\n  mount location, so refresh, deep links and browser Back all work. The\n  remote contract injects no router, so routing uses the history API.\n- V82 publishes the canonical 0.3.0 REPORTS manifest with the viewer\n  route; the Shell mounts a micro frontend only on a declared route. The\n  route reuses the landing route''s resource and action, so nothing widens.\n- Spring Security''s default X-Frame-Options: DENY on the BFF blocked the\n  same-origin frame. It is now SAMEORIGIN, matching the frame-ancestors\n  ''self'' that Nginx already sends; cross-origin framing stays blocked.\n\nAuthorization is unchanged: the catalog returns only authorized assets and\nevery Superset request is still authorized per asset by the BFF through\nOpenFGA. A denied subject requesting a report URL directly still gets 403\nACCESS_DENIED / SUPERSET_INTEGRATION_DENIED.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f17ab21eb22462b7df14d90a16c3a4cc0e76e24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/git/trees/9f17ab21eb22462b7df14d90a16c3a4cc0e76e24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/git/commits/c4e573342eaa4f3ee9745ca53c6e22c1fd56b53b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17072984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mahdiporkar","id":17072984,"login":"mahdiporkar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDcyOTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/commit/c4e573342eaa4f3ee9745ca53c6e22c1fd56b53b","node_id":"C_kwDOUchWttoAKGM0ZTU3MzM0MmVhYTRmM2VlOTc0NWNh