ar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T03:31:17Z","email":"mahdiporkar@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Porkar"},"message":"Synchronize Swagger/OpenAPI with runtime behavior and add drift protection\n\n- Canonical ApiError {code, message, correlationId} at runtime in both\n  services (exception handlers, admin interceptor 403, authentication\n  entry points, BFF controller advice); documented schema now equals\n  the real body (ApiErrorContractTest, BffErrorContractTest)\n- Error responses documented per operation instead of blanket\n  400/401/403/409/500 on everything; 502/504 only on upstream forwarders\n- Persian success/response descriptions; deterministic unique\n  operationIds; schema-aware Persian field docs for BFF DTOs\n- Enum values derived from the validating service constants\n- Production-neutral examples (no HR/Finance demo identifiers)\n- Set-based coverage tests (stale catalogue entries fail),\n  AuthorizationOpenApiContractIntegrationTest against the generated\n  document (bidirectional mapping sync, path params, $refs, example\n  validation, success codes), strengthened tools/verify-swagger.mjs\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f8c6c732de44a8befe713d109c746277a0d6b26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/git/trees/8f8c6c732de44a8befe713d109c746277a0d6b26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/git/commits/c5992409ecb5e9e5583de05d1965be9f664cb353","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17072984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mahdiporkar","id":17072984,"login":"mahdiporkar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDcyOTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/commit/c5992409ecb5e9e5583de05d1965be9f664cb353","node_id":"C_kwDOUchWttoAKGM1OTkyNDA5ZWNiNWU5ZTU1ODNkZTA1ZDE5NjViZTlmNjY0Y2IzNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/commit/a615a3e8cb0231ca337645c580a5d6a5a1d3b7a4","sha":"a615a3e8cb0231ca337645c580a5d6a5a1d3b7a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/commits/a615a3e8cb0231ca337645c580a5d6a5a1d3b7a4"}],"sha":"c5992409ecb5e9e5583de05d1965be9f664cb353","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/commits/c5992409ecb5e9e5583de05d1965be9f664cb353"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17072984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mahdiporkar","id":17072984,"login":"mahdiporkar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDcyOTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/commits/a615a3e8cb0231ca337645c580a5d6a5a1d3b7a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T03:31:16Z","email":"mahdiporkar@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Porkar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T03:31:16Z","email":"mahdiporkar@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Porkar"},"message":"Separate Aurevia Core from demo/E2E fixtures with a clean production baseline\n\nFresh installations now receive a generated Core-only Flyway baseline\n(db/baseline/B79__aurevia_core_baseline.sql) instead of the historical\nchain, so production never contains demo micro frontends, resources,\nusers, roles, grants, routes, Superset assets or their OpenFGA tuples.\nThe versioned chain V1..V79 stays immutable for existing databases.\n\n- tools/generate-core-baseline.mjs + tools/baseline/core-classification.sql\n  produce the baseline and the development fixture from one run\n- db/fixtures/development/*.sql: HR/Finance/Reports demo, integration\n  demo catalog and bootstrapped-administrator demo grants (opt-in only)\n- compose.yml is Core only; compose.development.yml carries fixtures,\n  mocks, operation gateway and dev-profile settings; E2E stacks on top\n- npm scripts: infra:core:up/down/verify, build:core/demo/e2e,\n  db:baseline:generate, e2e:production-core\n- CoreBaselineInstallationIntegrationTest proves from an empty database:\n  production is demo-free and complete, development restores the demo,\n  baseline + fixture == chain by natural keys and reconciler tuples\n- tools/production-core-e2e.mjs: Core-only stack, dynamic MFE\n  registration, OpenFGA grant visible in /api/me/context\n- docs/environments-core-development-e2e.md documents the model\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"302e2c2cf3961c3ef93ade59259cd29ea8df194d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/git/trees/302e2c2cf3961c3ef93ade59259cd29ea8df194d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/git/commits/a615a3e8cb0231ca337645c580a5d6a5a1d3b7a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17072984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mahdiporkar","id":17072984,"login":"mahdiporkar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDcyOTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/commit/a615a3e8cb0231ca337645c580a5d6a5a1d3b7a4","node_id":"C_kwDOUchWttoAKGE2MTVhM2U4Y2IwMjMxY2EzMzc2NDVjNTgwYTVkNmE1YTFkM2I3YTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/commit/701a69db0198511c2b57f68ce5bb6749a7fdffa0","sha":"701a69db0198511c2b57f68ce5bb6749a7fdffa0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/commits/701a69db0198511c2b57f68ce5bb6749a7fdffa0"}],"sha":"a615a3e8cb0231ca337645c580a5d6a5a1d3b7a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/commits/a615a3