i.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mahdiporkar","id":17072984,"login":"mahdiporkar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDcyOTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/commits/6ee483f52b7c6c1d141f17710ef4ce3c0ce2745e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T20:50:19Z","email":"mahdiporkar@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Porkar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T20:50:19Z","email":"mahdiporkar@gmail.com","name":"Mahdi Porkar"},"message":"fix(routing): make route resolution, path transformation and proxy errors deterministic\n\nAuthorization Service\n- Return the canonical OpenFGA object (resourceObject) and the fully\n  transformed downstream path (upstreamPath) from route resolution, so the\n  BFF never re-derives either. Operations bound to APPLICATION or\n  EXTERNAL_RESOURCE resources were always denied because the BFF assumed\n  \"resource:\" for every operation.\n- UpstreamPathPolicy is now the single implementation of stripPrefix /\n  rewrite / upstreamBasePath, shared by the admin preview and runtime\n  resolution. A rewrite that cannot apply is a 422 at runtime instead of\n  silently forwarding a path without its base path.\n- Validate stripPrefix against the prefix segment count\n  (STRIP_PREFIX_EXCEEDS_PATH_PREFIX); accept \"/\" as an operation pattern.\n- Runtime paths keep well-formed percent-encodings opaque (e.g. %20,\n  UTF-8 identifiers) and reject structural or malformed encodings;\n  route definitions remain encoding-free.\n\nBFF\n- Use resourceObject / upstreamPath from resolution with a fallback for\n  older servers; map upstream timeout to 504 and connection failure to 502.\n\nAdmin MFE\n- Translate every routing validation code to Persian, keeping the code.\n\nTests\n- RouteResolutionServiceTest (12): prefix > priority > specificity,\n  ambiguity as 409, method gating, canonical objects, encoding handling.\n- UpstreamPathPolicyTest (14): documented before/after path table.\n- OperationalProxyForwardingTest (10): exact forwarding and header\n  allowlist, 401 single refresh, 403 never refreshes, legacy 401\n  invalidate+retry, 413/502/504, transport mismatch.\n- tools/e2e-auth: wait for every session''s projection (removes a race).\n  Full harness: 41/41 PASS including real-browser cases.\n\nDocs: docs/proxy-routing-legacy-forward-fa.md (operating manual).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2428a474faed49a63cea0010e2ef6409d7ceb0d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/git/trees/2428a474faed49a63cea0010e2ef6409d7ceb0d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mahdiporkar/aurevia-super-app/git/commits/6ee483f52b7c6c1d141f17710ef4ce3c0ce2745e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17072984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahdiporkar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.co