r''s internal HTTP\nport 7107. It checks both PostgreSQL contexts, Vault, and Keycloak;\nliveness remains independent.\n- Reject health probe requests on the public API listener and other\nroutes on the internal listener.\n- Add integration coverage and document the deployment healthcheck\ncontract.\n\n## Linked issue\nCloses #30\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `dotnet build src/api/Faber.Api/Faber.Api.csproj --no-restore -m:1\n-p:UseSharedCompilation=false` (0 warnings, 0 errors)\n- [x] `DOCKER_HOST=\"${DOCKER_HOST:-unix:///var/run/docker.sock}\" dotnet\nrun --no-build --project tests/Integration/Faber.Api.Tests -- -class\n''*Health*''` (1 passed)\n- [ ] Validate the internal listener and public reverse proxy in a\ndeployed stack; leave port 7107 unpublished.\n\n## Notes\nThe deployment stack can switch its container healthcheck and smoke\ncheck to `http://<api-container>:7107/ready` and require HTTP 200. That\nseparate repository is not changed by this PR.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvs6vCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA02oQADLZpBvIadXv+PASyIIP5O9o\nv1i6BD2N9eReKrN/xuz/RHqaFbyFrOMyrVQjMg3kmqMvSrz90EWr1uZ/BvalaaBD\nrcyfvI9OBeYyrJlFBG3hHqgZVeoGd/1CBioznN4qSI2r2oVlatq0txGDWH7dX4w+\nmgB4chQNJ6UR9JyUT518+EdnGjzZyC0Nn8W0fSCDXY6vlEoyq629sVJ+aTWrzsJv\nh+YNKqkx/pjyfAWqI0zdAp+4MW0e545gKDYYxkcbtG4HzkO9i48QKFXTjbfSeMVO\nBJXO5+pQjHDWIzrO+2qRLiJyL4nf2tYZ/CNadgNcwhbSa0UegN1+LbEEZ+OmOgFC\n/zonbCpdkKdcTnMDxrWFWXddGTk+y+kTimuJ/inAaQqcPQ9IploLj+cAJYkf5rFs\nvJjtzSCNjN10byb4QAKbA6oVd2dXt+uANuLEQyuItTaU+kJv+Hvv7D3BxiRTQq/e\nqNx7hKVRVmpvOLEe9I7fFvwXUR1mDrhpmzQ8FO3xna5zu39X2tobWfclyxnRZI/r\nG2lLwN1Y+W40O1yWLSmlje5dHTApUNWTT5cbl6pjO32g05x4IGAKsySj4P5oNIUN\n211HTL4Tms3y4hKOfYcSlR+01u0iAHTsqb8ap8asFo0kFwuc1ODsTo58QNCRO562\n4VceBZWtH/3rfFTNrnCQ\n=4ZYg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T21:20:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flo