s/9a5df589e78012dd74379535e5e62a49e81e8ec7"}],"sha":"012900e090c0ce138986753455690365840c3424","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animarkode/faber/commits/012900e090c0ce138986753455690365840c3424"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103884938?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/animarkode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/animarkode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/animarkode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/animarkode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/animarkode","id":103884938,"login":"animarkode","node_id":"U_kgDOBjEoig","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/animarkode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/animarkode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/animarkode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/animarkode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/animarkode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/animarkode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animarkode/faber/commits/9a5df589e78012dd74379535e5e62a49e81e8ec7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T17:45:03Z","email":"103884938+VoxSollers@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alex Bell"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T17:45:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(web): reduce faber-web image to a static SPA server (#13)\n\n## Summary\n- `faber-web` is now only a static server for the Angular build. TLS,\nthe `keycloak.`/`vault.` subdomains, maintenance mode, rate limiting,\nenvsubst templating and the `FABER_*` contract are removed from the\nimage and the repo; they belong to the private deployment''s edge proxy.\n- New non-templated `src/web/faber-app/nginx.conf` (next to the\nDockerfile): port 80, SPA fallback, `public, immutable` for hashed\nassets, `no-cache` for `index.html`, gzip, the existing security headers\nand CSP (unchanged value), and a static `/healthz`.\n- Dockerfile runtime stage moves to `nginx:1.29-alpine`, `EXPOSE 80`\nonly, with a `HEALTHCHECK` on `/healthz`.\n- Also syncs `Faber.sln` / `Faber.slnx` solution items (root community\ndocs) — unrelated housekeeping in its own commit.\n\n**`/api/` proxy decision:** dropped. A bare `docker run` has no API\nbeside it, and keeping the proxy would bake a deployment''s service name\ninto the image. Routing `/api/` is the edge''s job; the SPA already calls\nthe relative `/api/v1`. Documented in the config header.\n\n## Linked issue\nCloses #12\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `docker build -f src/web/faber-app/Dockerfile -t faber-web:local\nsrc/web/faber-app` succeeds; `nginx -t` passes\n- [x] `docker run --rm -p 8080:80 faber-web:local` with no env vars or\nmounts: `/` and `/resumes` → 200 with CSP, HSTS, X-Frame-Options,\nX-Content-Type-Options, Referrer-Policy, X-XSS-Protection and\n`Cache-Control: no-cache`\n- [x] hashed `main-*.js` → `Cache-Control: public, immutable`; missing\n`main-DOESNOTEXIST.js` → 404; large chunk served with `Content-Encoding:\ngzip`\n- [x] `docker inspect` reports the container `healthy`\n- [x] `git grep -i -E\n''ssl_certificate|server_name|keycloak|vault|maintenance|FABER_APP_DOMAIN''\n-- src/web/faber-app` → empty\n- [x] `bash scripts/verify-public-snapshot.sh --preflight` passes;\n`scripts/verify-solution-projects.sh` passes\n- [x] `container-build.yml` passes\n- [x] Browser check at `http://localhost:8080`: SPA renders, fonts load,\nno CSP violations in the console\n\n## Notes\n> [!WARNING]\n> **Do not release this until the private deployment has its own edge\nproxy in front of `faber-web`**, or production is pinned to an explicit\n`faber-vX.Y.Z` tag instead of `latest`. Otherwise production loses TLS\nand the Keycloak/Vault subdomains on the next image pull.\n\n- Known, carried over from the old config: the asset regex matches by\nextension, so unhashed `public/` files (`favicon.ico`, `flags/*.svg`)\nalso get `public, immutable` for a year. Not changed here.","tree":{"sha":"c8828207d3afaee40ef4541c2b2e2e873dbb34a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animarkode/faber/git/trees/c8828207d3afaee40ef4541c2b2e2e873dbb34a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animarkode/faber/git/commits/9a5df589e78012dd74379535e5e62a49e81e8ec7","verification":{"payload":"tree c8828207d3afaee40ef4541c2b2e2e873dbb34a9\nparent df63d0dd82b48c14196a776bc4b243aa9945f7d9\nauthor Alex Bell <103884938+VoxSollers@users.noreply.github.com> 1789580703 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789580703 +0200\n\nrefactor(web): reduce faber-web image to a static SPA server (#13)\n\n## Summary\n- `faber-web` is now only a static server for the Angular build. TLS,\nthe `keycloak.`/`vault.` subdomains, maintenance mode, rate limiting,\nenvsubst templating and the `FABER_*` contract are removed from the\nimage and the repo; they belong to the private deployment''s edge proxy.\n- New non-templated `src/web/faber-app/nginx.conf` (next to the\nDockerfile): port 80, SPA fallback, `public, immutable` for hashed\nassets, `no-cache` for `index.html`, gzip, the existing security headers\nand CSP (unchanged value), and a static `/healthz`.\n- Dockerfile runtime stage moves to `nginx:1.29-alpine`, `EXPOSE 80`\nonly, with a `HEALTHCHECK` on `/healthz`.\n- Also syncs `Faber.sln` / `Faber.slnx` solution items (root community\ndocs) — unrelated housekeeping in its own commit.\n\n**`/api/` proxy decision:** dropped. A bare `docker run` has no API\nbeside it, and keeping the proxy would bake a deployment''s service name\ninto the image. Routing `/api/` is the edge''s job; the SPA already calls\nthe relative `/api/v1`. Documented in the config header.\n\n## Linked issue\nCloses #12\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `docker build -f src/web/faber-app/Dockerfile -t faber-web:local\nsrc/web/faber-app` succeeds; `nginx -t` passes\n- [x] `docker run --rm -p 8080:80 faber-web:local` with no env vars or\nmounts: `/` and `/resumes` → 200 with CSP, HSTS, X-Frame-Options,\nX-Content-Type-Options, Referrer-Policy, X-XSS-Protection and\n`Cache-Control: no-cache`\n- [x] hashed `main-*.js` → `Cache-Control: public, immutable`; missing\n`main-DOESNOTEXIST.js` → 404; large chunk served with `Content-Encoding:\ngzip`\n- [x] `docker inspect` reports the container `healthy`\n- [x] `git grep -i -E\n''ssl_certificate|server_name|keycloak|vault|maintenance|FABER_APP_DOMAIN''\n-- src/web/faber-app` → empty\n- [x] `bash scripts/verify-public-snapshot.sh --preflight` passes;\n`scripts/verify-solution-projects.sh` passes\n- [x] `container-build.yml` passes\n- [x] Browser check at `http://localhost:8080`: SPA renders, fonts load,\nno CSP violations in the console\n\n## Notes\n> [!WARNING]\n> **Do not release this until the private deployment has its own edge\nproxy in front of `faber-web`**, or production is pinned to an explicit\n`faber-vX.Y.Z` tag instead of `latest`. Otherwise production loses TLS\nand the Keycloak/Vault subdomains on the next image pull.\n\n- Known, carried over from the old config: the asset regex matches by\nextension, so unhashed `public/` files (`favicon.ico`, `flags/*.svg`)\nalso get `public, immutable` for a year. Not changed here.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqtWfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkWcQAK5Dj+oQVihzGBCyrvSheAuJ\nxIbHKE39SmeTOpvX9AaZACJxi/KD0O72RAou8HlRCv18kMHIcKZZ5hZ04pqfIsCi\ndAh8BmSNm98KrrdBLeIG+i+9+zcXnEvl8/zysobzRmN+tY4TpFQi/RSPDrBow3ZJ\ntvcliqjSkdfkCL0n+YywPYxQlzZ492h6CNHO7R1oK4fbWrSmvdx7JwWXPVNv19Ia\nlU56vARZwieTS5H29pAKizTGqb81TyeqeuppsH75fXk/rLGd2yywSSBhSC+wg8tG\n7VeLwO9lqkf8AELI/6+INH/7wY79xZUzdV2zLMX7/s3MhNEjoomE166NCK/T78eS\noRmMZ965d9EengZNevZzi1w0Px0vt/bPqs9PeYypr2o03073BSDLuBVENsxqfUho\nJd82ZdvlnDLzvdxb4Rit0hFa11erPPA/FhgNcECLxlVG2K2kEFJG/WlfmFQa4fNR\nYpztdEstS38Pdz8vA/XOSoLrrLpYAROG/dApP87AZ6OVGbRV4JtEFg/ETJcwUpv3\nVcC