ers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/animarkode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/animarkode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/animarkode","id":103884938,"login":"animarkode","node_id":"U_kgDOBjEoig","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/animarkode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/animarkode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/animarkode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/animarkode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/animarkode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/animarkode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animarkode/faber/commits/df63d0dd82b48c14196a776bc4b243aa9945f7d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:06:44Z","email":"103884938+VoxSollers@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alex Bell"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:06:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(ci): build release images when release-please creates the release (#11)\n\n## Problem\n\n`faber-v0.2.1` was created by release-please with the default\n`GITHUB_TOKEN`. GitHub does not start workflows from events raised by\nthat token, so the `release: published` trigger in `build-images.yml`\nnever fired and no images were built. Only a release published by a\nperson triggers it.\n\n## Change\n\n- `build-images.yml` also accepts `workflow_call` with a required `tag`\ninput. The job checks out that tag and uses it for image tags. For a\n`release` event it falls back to `github.ref_name`, so a release\npublished by hand behaves as before.\n- `release-please.yml` exposes `release_created` and `tag_name` from the\naction and, when a release was created, calls `build-images.yml` with\n`contents: read` and `packages: write`.\n\nNo new secrets or tokens. The `chore` type does not trigger a release.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `actionlint` reports no findings for both workflows.\n- Output names checked against the README of `release-please-action` at\nthe pinned commit.\n- The reusable path runs only when the next release is created. The\n`release` path is exercised now by the republished `faber-v0.2.1`.","tree":{"sha":"8cfa7129bb6bb5cddc65a699fd001b66107db0a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animarkode/faber/git/trees/8cfa7129bb6bb5cddc65a699fd001b66107db0a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animarkode/faber/git/commits/df63d0dd82b48c14196a776bc4b243aa9945f7d9","verification":{"payload":"tree 8cfa7129bb6bb5cddc65a699fd001b66107db0a9\nparent 86aeda46ef90bff4b481c7abda2f1e1ca7d8e43a\nauthor Alex Bell <103884938+VoxSollers@users.noreply.github.com> 1789560404 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789560404 +0200\n\nchore(ci): build release images when release-please creates the release (#11)\n\n## Problem\n\n`faber-v0.2.1` was created by release-please with the default\n`GITHUB_TOKEN`. GitHub does not start workflows from events raised by\nthat token, so the `release: published` trigger in `build-images.yml`\nnever fired and no images were built. Only a release published by a\nperson triggers it.\n\n## Change\n\n- `build-images.yml` also accepts `workflow_call` with a required `tag`\ninput. The job checks out that tag and uses it for image tags. For a\n`release` event it falls back to `github.ref_name`, so a release\npublished by hand behaves as before.\n- `release-please.yml` exposes `release_created` and `tag_name` from the\naction and, when a release was created, calls `build-images.yml` with\n`contents: read` and `packages: write`.\n\nNo new secrets or tokens. The `chore` type does not trigger a release.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `actionlint` reports no findings for both workflows.\n- Output names checked against the README of `release-please-action` at\nthe pinned commit.\n- The reusable path runs only when the next release is created. The\n`release` path is exercised now by the republished `faber-v0.2.1`.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqoZUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWacQAFJxlp/evAF6LCrM1Suy1sTw\n0vQZbLL9UA+e4+SQ+uTy3yOTqddM82VjZF37uX+YDLIWwn/2c55sQFjmlKv42Qcx\noL7lP2K11bUbDtshM8HtBRqX9B9MmTQRMmcTd9Fscvo3J6pvwwKvurOFyRaQOCBV\n5WRmx9RqVRwUL6jYykw5L7X/lUXQ7D3zWiOgwseO2So3+1VUI9FddLUeNNgYVSqZ\n0BQUj9a2c5hcRc+DwEDevzwnEAN0bb0nU4CmLK3dIKHGJstDQE2i1yc3W851LYzm\n6NgHj6ruUlHIzkagB44upae0nc59S34aK/244aPAlqRX3TThNLlxIa9WBFslfypb\nVgB3wlWdyAVcbfvNNe1V8lqLxeBj2tmXtavRAnMieU6x2yX8uOTJRGhKAoTtgQ3R\nCm56JxEcLG9Zh9aF57f2vQG5tuPo04nT0GAn3hbr/V2vMPZMjwrq/2daUtAJjZoJ\nYVnwZvt0RGk2Cku29HLJ63OAcOHmuBQEHciVBFlZMFRj7/NblTXeWiTKu6oqpUR9\nj3tgxNPNi43/qJ1zQ4nbHYW59lNkyS7Rs5oZcFK23x+/mgnx6+bWddkqgzrHC9bb\n+nHouGFqHJV1mFUYNAmZxOfoAZhRLZNHQvY69Q6K9E53bSpIVl6JTi3H8Nf/YEHH\nprsKDZ0dvIZvMwCXLaCr\n=9umb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T12:06:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/animarkode/faber/commit/df63d0dd82b