333,"login":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animarkode/faber/commits/c57dc369c55e28bbf40471e98c636d40ebbea048/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T23:25:41Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T23:25:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(ui-shared): bump tailwind-merge from 3.6.0 to 3.7.0 in /src/web/faber-app (#3)\n\nBumps\n[tailwind-merge](https://github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/tree/HEAD/packages/tailwind-merge)\nfrom 3.6.0 to 3.7.0.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/releases\">tailwind-merge''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>tailwind-merge@3.7.0</h2>\n<h3>New Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Prepare some upcoming changes by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil\"><code>@​dcastil</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/713\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#713</a>\n<ul>\n<li>Theme getters returned by <code>fromTheme</code> now expose the\ntheme key they read as a <code>themeKey</code> property, so tooling can\nidentify the referenced theme scale without calling the getter.</li>\n<li>Release tags now include the package name, starting with\n<code>tailwind-merge@3.7.0</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix arbitrary values using <code>color()</code> or\n<code>light-dark()</code> being classified as lengths instead of colors\nby <a href=\"https://github.com/ddussi\"><code>@​ddussi</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/712\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#712</a></li>\n<li>Fix bare <code>bg-conic</code> not merging with other background\nimage classes by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil\"><code>@​dcastil</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/708\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#708</a></li>\n<li>Fix <code>columns-auto</code> not conflicting with other\n<code>columns</code> classes by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil\"><code>@​dcastil</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/707\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#707</a></li>\n<li>Fix container sizes like <code>inline-2xl</code> not merging by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil\"><code>@​dcastil</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/706\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#706</a></li>\n<li>Fix <code>max-h-none</code> missing in max-h class group by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/mutewinter\"><code>@​mutewinter</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/704\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#704</a></li>\n<li>Fix axis shorthands like <code>px</code> not overriding logical\nsides like <code>ps</code> by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil\"><code>@​dcastil</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/705\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#705</a></li>\n<li>Fix <code>leading-none</code> being removed when the leading theme\nscale is overridden by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/chatman-media\"><code>@​chatman-media</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/689\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#689</a></li>\n<li>Fix deprecated <code>shadow-inner</code> being classified as shadow\ncolor instead of shadow by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil\"><code>@​dcastil</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/703\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#703</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Documentation</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Add Deno to install instructions by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/bartlomieju\"><code>@​bartlomieju</code></a> in\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/687\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#687</a></li>\n<li>Add missing <code>text-shadow</code> theme key to configuration docs\nby <a href=\"https://github.com/dcastil\"><code>@​dcastil</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/commit/3e6d2080a9905b5cc55f4b1515450544e761ded7\">https://github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/commit/3e6d2080a9905b5cc55f4b1515450544e761ded7</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Other</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Switch package manager from yarn to pnpm by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil\"><code>@​dcastil</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/680\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#680</a></li>\n<li>Harden CI security by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil\"><code>@​dcastil</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/679\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#679</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/compare/v3.6.0...tailwind-merge@3.7.0\"><code>v3.6.0...v3.7.0</code></a></p>\n<p>Thanks to <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/brandonmcconnell\"><code>@​brandonmcconnell</code></a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/manavm1990\"><code>@​manavm1990</code></a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/langy\"><code>@​langy</code></a>, <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/roboflow\"><code>@​roboflow</code></a>, <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/syntaxfm\"><code>@​syntaxfm</code></a>, <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/getsentry\"><code>@​getsentry</code></a>, <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/codecov\"><code>@​codecov</code></a>, a private\nsponsor, <a\nhref=\"https: