wind-merge@3.7.0</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix arbitrary values using <code>color()</code> or\n<code>light-dark()</code> being classified as lengths instead of colors\nby <a href=\"https://github.com/ddussi\"><code>@​ddussi</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/712\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#712</a></li>\n<li>Fix bare <code>bg-conic</code> not merging with other background\nimage classes by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil\"><code>@​dcastil</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/708\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#708</a></li>\n<li>Fix <code>columns-auto</code> not conflicting with other\n<code>columns</code> classes by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil\"><code>@​dcastil</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/707\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#707</a></li>\n<li>Fix container sizes like <code>inline-2xl</code> not merging by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil\"><code>@​dcastil</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/706\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#706</a></li>\n<li>Fix <code>max-h-none</code> missing in max-h class group by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/mutewinter\"><code>@​mutewinter</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/704\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#704</a></li>\n<li>Fix axis shorthands like <code>px</code> not overriding logical\nsides like <code>ps</code> by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil\"><code>@​dcastil</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/705\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#705</a></li>\n<li>Fix <code>leading-none</code> being removed when the leading theme\nscale is overridden by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/chatman-media\"><code>@​chatman-media</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/689\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#689</a></li>\n<li>Fix deprecated <code>shadow-inner</code> being classified as shadow\ncolor instead of shadow by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil\"><code>@​dcastil</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/703\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#703</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Documentation</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Add Deno to install instructions by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/bartlomieju\"><code>@​bartlomieju</code></a> in\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/687\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#687</a></li>\n<li>Add missing <code>text-shadow</code> theme key to configuration docs\nby <a href=\"https://github.com/dcastil\"><code>@​dcastil</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/commit/3e6d2080a9905b5cc55f4b1515450544e761ded7\">https://github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/commit/3e6d2080a9905b5cc55f4b1515450544e761ded7</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Other</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Switch package manager from yarn to pnpm by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil\"><code>@​dcastil</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/680\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#680</a></li>\n<li>Harden CI security by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil\"><code>@​dcastil</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/pull/679\">dcastil/tailwind-merge#679</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/compare/v3.6.0...tailwind-merge@3.7.0\"><code>v3.6.0...v3.7.0</code></a></p>\n<p>Thanks to <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/brandonmcconnell\"><code>@​brandonmcconnell</code></a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/manavm1990\"><code>@​manavm1990</code></a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/langy\"><code>@​langy</code></a>, <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/roboflow\"><code>@​roboflow</code></a>, <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/syntaxfm\"><code>@​syntaxfm</code></a>, <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/getsentry\"><code>@​getsentry</code></a>, <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/codecov\"><code>@​codecov</code></a>, a private\nsponsor, <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/openclaw\"><code>@​openclaw</code></a>, <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sourcegraph\"><code>@​sourcegraph</code></a>, <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/cesarvcanal\"><code>@​cesarvcanal</code></a>, <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CasperKristiansson\"><code>@​CasperKristiansson</code></a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/jbisasky\"><code>@​jbisasky</code></a>, <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/frontendmasters\"><code>@​frontendmasters</code></a>\nand more via <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/thnxdev\"><code>@​thnxdev</code></a> for\nsponsoring tailwind-merge! ❤️</p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/commit/511d68a65d8fa11ae8a549b5a1d5cf4dced41101\"><code>511d68a</code></a>\ntailwind-merge@3.7.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/commit/24611270412a7d25f9a25d9c6d544edecf496e2f\"><code>2461127</code></a>\nRelease tooling: Pass the namespaced tag prefix and commit message to\npnpm''s ...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/commit/9d41508332de6e2fa0da4892b4c2b5d4024d697e\"><code>9d41508</code></a>\nadd changelog for tailwind-merge@3.7.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/commit/c78a80f69b37750f2ec886629d4dc3778461036b\"><code>c78a80f</code></a>\nConfigurator: Reuse runtime lookups during pruning</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/commit/49c317d76d7f4e683dc8698e92f5df0912966d37\"><code>49c317d</code></a>\nMonorepo: Fix contributing link and include package coverage</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/commit/7b565ca71cdeb38975a161d428ecee8cbfd0b1e7\"><code>7b565ca</code></a>\nConfigurator: prune a generated config to a project''s used classes (core\nstep)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/commit/d83e013d95ffa04b829dac5222a84b85f5e33190\"><code>d83e013</code></a>\nReleases: auto-re-pin tag-pinned links on every version bump</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/commit/b71fd419b68bf9a8405b46434d2d1bc891e0dca6\"><code>b71fd41</code></a>\nDocs: pin every in-repo file link to a release tag instead of main</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/commit/ee29441c71ae8974a406708a170379d014de7dc2\"><code>ee29441</code></a>\nDocs: point the ThemeObject JSDoc link at the packaged docs\nlocation</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/commit/9521b10eb64881c6f84515be70fd80c1a4f60188\"><code>9521b10</code></a>\nReleases: per-package pipeline with namespaced tags</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge/commits/tailwind-merge@3.7.0/packages/tailwind-merge\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility\nscore](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=tailwind-merge&package-manager=npm_and_yarn&previous-version=3.6.0&new-version=3.7.0)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don''t\nalter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting\n`@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits\nthat have been made to it\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all\nof the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this 