5020gg/softgic/commit/b976678624858ee140085cc2a4327f581986ce8e","sha":"b976678624858ee140085cc2a4327f581986ce8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santiago5020gg/softgic/commits/b976678624858ee140085cc2a4327f581986ce8e"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/santiago5020gg/softgic/commit/288cb5efc327fbff81decab4383b4a0e900e83f7","sha":"288cb5efc327fbff81decab4383b4a0e900e83f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santiago5020gg/softgic/commits/288cb5efc327fbff81decab4383b4a0e900e83f7"}],"sha":"d47e040e4813b24c5d9e3ceeda43e16be9272e8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santiago5020gg/softgic/commits/d47e040e4813b24c5d9e3ceeda43e16be9272e8f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santiago5020gg/softgic/commits/288cb5efc327fbff81decab4383b4a0e900e83f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T22:32:48Z","email":"srestrepo@asbabogados.com","name":"dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T22:32:48Z","email":"srestrepo@asbabogados.com","name":"dev"},"message":"feat(devops): Fase 6 — Helm, GitLab CI y documentación final (A7)\n\n- helm/plataforma-solicitudes: chart con Deployment/Service/ConfigMap/Secret ref,\n  probes readiness+liveness (/actuator/health/*) y recursos por servicio; secretos\n  por secretKeyRef/existingSecret. helm lint + template verdes.\n- .gitlab-ci.yml: build -> test -> coverage(JaCoCo) -> package(4 imagenes) ->\n  helm(lint+template) -> deploy(manual). Secretos por variables de CI.\n- docs: openapi-solicitudes.json (export real) + openapi.md; event-contracts/\n  (5 ejemplos + README); modelo-de-datos.md (operacional vs estrella, erDiagram).\n- USO_DE_IA.md y README.md completados (estructura sugerida del reto).\n\nA7 verificado: docker compose down -v + up --build desde cero -> 7 contenedores\narriba, servicios healthy, realm importado, A1 crear->201, recorrido->200,\nindicadores por Kafka, frontend y remoteEntry sirviendo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"18a3369f80550