url":"https://github.com/santiago5020gg/softgic/commit/0ceccc5ab73ea64fd5ed22a4a62fd7df8d0b112e","sha":"0ceccc5ab73ea64fd5ed22a4a62fd7df8d0b112e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santiago5020gg/softgic/commits/0ceccc5ab73ea64fd5ed22a4a62fd7df8d0b112e"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/santiago5020gg/softgic/commit/88f609fdf8e2436333497c67d3adc5242eb84557","sha":"88f609fdf8e2436333497c67d3adc5242eb84557","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santiago5020gg/softgic/commits/88f609fdf8e2436333497c67d3adc5242eb84557"}],"sha":"c48fbbd4a6986533b8246fdfe33577b2541229e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santiago5020gg/softgic/commits/c48fbbd4a6986533b8246fdfe33577b2541229e5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santiago5020gg/softgic/commits/88f609fdf8e2436333497c67d3adc5242eb84557/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T21:54:44Z","email":"srestrepo@asbabogados.com","name":"dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T21:54:44Z","email":"srestrepo@asbabogados.com","name":"dev"},"message":"feat(seguridad): Fase 3 — Keycloak OIDC, Resource Server y RBAC en servidor (A3)\n\n- keycloak/realm-export.json: realm ''solicitudes'', roles SOLICITANTE/ANALISTA/\n  SUPERVISOR, client publico solicitudes-shell (PKCE), 3 usuarios de prueba.\n- compose: keycloak --import-realm; env JWK_SET_URI (interno) + ISSUER (host).\n- Ambos servicios como Resource Server: JwtDecoder con JWKS interna + validacion\n  de issuer del host; JwtAuthConverter (realm_access -> ROLE_*); stateless, CORS.\n- svc-solicitudes: RBAC por rol/accion (crear=SOLICITANTE, tomar/resolver=ANALISTA,\n  devolver/cerrar=SUPERVISOR); actor desde el JWT (elimina header X-Usuario).\n- 401/403 como JSON coherente.\n\nVerificado end-to-end con tokens reales: sin token->401; ana crea->201;\nana cerrar->403 (A3); carlos tomar/resolver->200; sofia cerrar->200;\nindicadores sin token->401 / con token->200.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1e0963538afc905375d372fd22aa61874fb4c77c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santiago5020gg/softgic/git/trees/1e0963538afc905375d372fd22aa61874fb4c77c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santiago5020gg/softgic/git/commits/88f609fdf8e2436333497c67d3adc5242eb84557","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/santiago5020gg/softgic/commit/88f609fdf8e2436333497c67d3adc5242eb84557","node_id":"C_kwDOUcqvqNoAKDg4ZjYwOWZkZjhlMjQzNjMzMzQ5N2M2N2QzYWRjNTI0MmViODQ1NTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/santiago5020gg/softgic/commit/0ceccc5ab73ea64fd5ed22a4a62fd7df8d0b112e","sha":"0ceccc5ab73ea64fd5ed22a4a62fd7df8d0b112e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santiago5020gg/softgic/commits/0ceccc5ab73ea64fd5ed22a4a62fd7df8d0b112e"}],"sha":"88f609fdf8e2436333497c67d3adc5242eb84557","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/santiago5020gg/softgic/commits/88f609fdf8e2436333497c67d3adc5242eb84557"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63065466?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiago5020gg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiago5020gg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiago5020gg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiago5020gg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santiago5020gg","id":63065466,"login":"santiago5020gg","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMDY1NDY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiago5020gg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiago5020gg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiago5020gg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiago5020gg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiago5020gg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiago5020gg","user_vie