ner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commits/6811e221b4bbf1e76bec3a7bb744541288f10fc9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T15:04:36Z","email":"myeonghan12@gmail.com","name":"David Myeonghan Ryu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T15:04:36Z","email":"myeonghan12@gmail.com","name":"David Myeonghan Ryu"},"message":"fix: 문제·대안·비용·측정 줄 중 두세 단어짜리 45개를 문장으로 보완 (38문항)\n\n전수 대조 2차. 14자 미만 필드를 자동으로 골라 전부 \"무엇을·왜·어떻게\" 가 드러나는 문장으로 바꿨다.\n예: #88 비용 \"리프팅 코드.\" → \"상태를 공통 부모로 올리는 리프팅 코드와 콜백 전달이 늘어난다. 부모가 너무 멀면 컨텍스트·스토어 검토가 따라온다.\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018BrAuW7SfQ51RS4CLY4yfX","tree":{"sha":"793aa8a3b710dc44613669e9cce497babd8cfd8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/trees/793aa8a3b710dc44613669e9cce497babd8cfd8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/commits/6811e221b4bbf1e76bec3a7bb744541288f10fc9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26461008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan","id":26461008,"login":"David-Myeonghan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDYxMDA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-