pi.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commits/6330a43f52da06a936ccd8b6983513b0ce433078/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T09:42:56Z","email":"myeonghan12@gmail.com","name":"David Myeonghan Ryu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T09:42:56Z","email":"myeonghan12@gmail.com","name":"David Myeonghan Ryu"},"message":"feat: 우선 110문항에 「기준 → 결론」 두 줄 추가 — 시니어·토스·대본 노드\n\n답의 배치를 나열에서 구조로 바꾼다. 각 문항 맨 위에\n- 기준: 이 문제를 나누는 판단 축 한 문장\n- 결론: 그 축에서 나오는 결론 한 문장\n을 두고, 기존 핵심 답은 「이유」로 그 아래에 배치한다(내용은 그대로).\n\n- 대상: 시니어 52 + 토스 26 + 딥다이브 대본 노드 (중복 제거 110문항)\n- 렌더: 질문 아래 강조 블록, 검색 대상 포함. README 는 기준/결론/이유 순으로 출력\n- 남은 79문항(주니어·미들 지식 문항, 라이브 코딩 일부, 과제·AI)은 다음 커밋\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012XMa27Gyj5hrtYd6dk5CRt","tree":{"sha":"898fdc88c11918da5a603b37bfcbf1dc05809cb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/trees/898fdc88c11918da5a603b37bfcbf1dc05809cb3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/commits/6330a43f52da06a936ccd8b6983513b0ce433078","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26461008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan","id":26461008,"login":"David-Mye