d_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commits/360181fe695383d9e2932db297b89fbe89d58604/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T09:38:30Z","email":"myeonghan12@gmail.com","name":"David Myeonghan Ryu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T09:38:30Z","email":"myeonghan12@gmail.com","name":"David Myeonghan Ryu"},"message":"feat: 공통 채점 기준 「답의 구조」 — 기준 먼저 · 결론 먼저 · 빠진 가지 · 안 맞는 경우 · 측정\n\n- 모든 문항 카드에 구조 채점 줄(5항목, 마우스 오버로 설명) 추가\n- 셀프 퀴즈 모드에 「내 답 점검」 체크 5칸 추가 — 답한 뒤 스스로 구조를 확인\n- 딥다이브 대본 49단계 전부의 「막히면」 분기에 표준 구조 힌트 추가:\n  \"이 문제를 어떤 기준으로 나눌 수 있을까요? 기준을 먼저 하나 정하고 결론부터 말해 보세요.\"\n- 면접관 사용법·README 에 공통 채점 기준 절 추가\n\n배경: 189문항 첫 불릿을 훑으니 판단 기준·결론을 먼저 세운 문항이 10개뿐(정의형 60, 나열형 다수).\n내용은 맞지만 배치가 나열이라, 다음 커밋부터 문항마다 「기준 한 줄 · 결론 한 줄」을 맨 위에 붙인다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012XMa27Gyj5hrtYd6dk5CRt","tree":{"sha":"842395627391f900dacfe319ef6f228ceb3a669a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/trees/842395627391f900dacfe319ef6f228ceb3a669a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/commits/360181fe695383d9e2932db297b89fbe89d58604","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26461008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan","id":26461008,"login":"David-Myeonghan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDYxMDA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commit/360181fe695383d9e2932db297b89fbe89d58604","node_id":"C_kwDOUc2DYtoAKDM2MDE4MWZlNjk1MzgzZDllMjkzMmRiMjk3Yjg5ZmJlODlkNTg2MDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commit/95f9daf71dc1d81c48bea8fbd6525d889b4a6b92","sha":"95f9daf71dc1d81c48bea8fbd6525d889b4a6b92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commits/95f9daf71dc1d81c48bea8fbd6525d889b4a6b92"}],"sha":"360181fe695383d9e2932db297b89fbe89d58604","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commits/360181fe695383d9e2932db297b89fbe89d58604"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26461008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan","id":26461008,"login":"David-Myeonghan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDYxMDA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commits/95f9daf71dc1d81c48bea8fbd6525d889b4a6b92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T01:38:17Z","email":"myeonghan12@gmail.com","name":"David Myeonghan Ryu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T01:38:17Z","email":"myeonghan12@gmail.com","name":"David Myeonghan Ryu"},"message":"feat: 토스 예상 문항 26개 + 「토스 1차 면접」 딥다이브 대본 — 출처 등급 표기\n\n국내외 웹 검색으로 토스 프론트엔드 전형을 조사해 신설. 문항마다 출처 등급을 붙였다.\n\n출제·평가 확인 8 (토스 공식 자료·후기에서 확인)\n- 코딩테스트 3파트(프로그래밍·서술형·객관식)와 출제 기준 — NEXT 2024 출제진 기사, NEXT 25 FE 합격 수기\n- TDD 형태 과제·제한 시간·리뷰어 가독성 — 출제진 기사, 합격 수기, 경력 후기(10시간)\n- 1차 = 과제 리뷰(개선점 짚기), 라이브 코딩(AI 자동완성 끄기·의사코드 허용) — 경력 후기 2025-08\n- \"Next.js 를 왜 썼나\" — 모닥불 EP.8(면접관 직접 발언)·EP.6\n- \"상태 관리 라이브러리 설명\" — 합격 수기에 질문 명시\n- 2차 실무 시나리오(트래픽 급증·레거시 부채), 피드백 방식(컬처) — 후기·면접관 발언\n\n토스 공개자료 기반 예상 16\n- Frontend Fundamentals 좋은 코드 4기준, 폴더 구조·추상화 범위, 유효성 실패는 에러인가(EP.10)\n- 선언적 비동기(SLASH 21·Suspensive), 오버레이(overlay-kit), 퍼널(SLASH 23·use-funnel)\n- 번들 사이즈(es-toolkit), 웹뷰·앱 브릿지(JD·App Router 글), Server-driven UI(SLASH 23)\n- 모노리포 카탈로그(100+ 엔지니어 글), 기술 도입 판단(App Router 측정: WebKit FCP 5,065ms)\n- 필터·정렬을 브라우저로(광고 대시보드 글: 상한 확정·워커·Transferable), 코드 리뷰 문화(EP.12)\n- 테스트 자동화(EP.3), 함수형 프로그래밍(EP.10), 한글 초성 검색(es-hangul)\n\n도메인·JD 기반 예상 2 — 금액 정밀도(IEEE 754·Intl.NumberFormat·BigInt), 민감정보 로깅(OWASP)\n\n- 딥다이브 대본 「토스 1차 면접 — 과제 리뷰에서 라이브 코딩까지」 7단계(60분)\n- 코드 예제 12개(초성 검색·브릿지·퍼널 타입·워커 Transferable·금액 등), 꼬리질문 52단계\n- 인라인 code 가 CODE 맵에 덮이던 우선순위 수정\n- 고유 레퍼런스 242 → 281개, 전부 HTTP 200. 렌더 검증(Chrome): 문항 189 · 토스 26 · 대본 7/49단계 · 콘솔 에러 0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012XMa27Gyj5hrtYd6dk5CRt","tree":{"sha":"e0d6f76899d4e5a8a553d5e7836162ecd5d83f3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/trees/e0d6f76899d4e5a8a553d5e7836162ecd5d83f3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/commits/95f9daf71dc1d81c48bea8fbd6525d889b4a6b92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26461008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan","id":26461008,"login":"David-Myeonghan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDYxMDA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commit/95f9daf71dc1d81c48bea8fbd6525d889b4a6b92","node_id":"C_kwDOUc2DYtoAKDk1ZjlkYWY3MWRjMWQ4MWM0OGJlYThmYmQ2NTI1ZDg4OWI0YTZiOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commit/dd5cb1e548a6e817f730ec81a99d05b8b9cf886f","sha":"dd5cb1e548a6e817f730ec81a99d05b8b9cf886f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit