":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26461008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan","id":26461008,"login":"David-Myeonghan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDYxMDA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commits/d990a3a8be8325303a0d8a06c22348e5bbd73e7c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T01:02:53Z","email":"myeonghan12@gmail.com","name":"David Myeonghan Ryu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T01:02:53Z","email":"myeonghan12@gmail.com","name":"David Myeonghan Ryu"},"message":"feat: 딥다이브 대본 6주제(42단계) + 심층 답 42문항 — 한 주제를 20~45분 파는 흐름\n\n문항이 독립 노드라 \"한 문제 묻고 다음으로\" 넘어가던 구조를 보완한다.\n\n딥다이브 대본 (상단 「딥다이브 대본」 탭)\n- 이벤트 루프와 비동기 / 렌더링 파이프라인과 성능 / React 렌더와 상태 /\n  네트워크·캐시·인증 / 접근성 / 시스템 디자인(뉴스 피드, RADIO 45분)\n- 단계마다: 질문 · 기대 답 · 레벨 기준선(주니어/미들/시니어가 어디까지) ·\n  분기(잘 답하면 → 심화 질문 / 막히면 → 힌트 + 우회 질문) · 연결 문항 · 레퍼런스\n- 대본 ↔ 문항 왕복 링크(문항 카드에 「대본 ·」 태그, 대본 단계에 「문항 보기」)\n\n심층 답 (대본이 거치는 42문항, 접이식)\n- 왜 그렇게 동작하나(원리) · 실무에서 어떻게 드러나나(증상) · 어떻게 확인하나(측정) ·\n  안 맞는 경우(반례) · 스펙·문서 근거(절 링크 + 한 줄 요지)\n- 근거는 표준 문서 우선: HTML 표준 이벤트 루프 처리 모델, ECMAScript Jobs, Fetch CORS,\n  RFC 9111/9700/7636/6749, WAI-ARIA 1.2, ARIA in HTML, WCAG 2.2 각 성공 기준,\n  Long Tasks/Event Timing/LCP/Layout Instability API, Service Workers 등\n\n- 고유 레퍼런스 218 → 242개, 전부 HTTP 200\n- 렌더 검증(Chrome/Playwright): 문항 163 · 코드 114 · 심층 42 · 대본 6/42단계 ·\n  대본→문항 이동·심층 자동 펼침 동작 · 콘솔 에러 0 · 실패 요청 0\n- 텍스트 필드의 <script> 문자열이 innerHTML 에서 태그로 파싱돼 대본 2개만 보이던 결함을\n  잡아 &lt; 로 이스케이프. export.mjs 가드에 태그 시작 검출 추가\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012XMa27Gyj5hrtYd6dk5CRt","tree":{"sha":"bd9a724b2a687ac0b58789a7872ff2fbc40a5c96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/trees/bd9a724b2a687ac0b58789a7872ff2fbc40a5c96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/commits/d990a3a8be8325303a0d8a06c22348e5bbd73e7c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26461008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan","id":26461008,"login":"David-Myeonghan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDYxMDA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeongha