12@gmail.com","name":"David Myeonghan Ryu"},"message":"fix: 코드 예제 안 </script> 가 인라인 스크립트를 조기 종료해 페이지 전체가 깨지던 문제\n\n원인: LCP 문항의 HTML 예제에 <script src=\"/app.js\" defer></script> 를 그대로 넣었다.\nHTML 파서는 인라인 <script> 안의 첫 </script> 를 종료 태그로 읽으므로, 그 지점부터\n나머지 데이터·PROBES·CODE·렌더 코드가 전부 본문 텍스트로 새고 스크립트는\n\"Unexpected end of input\" 으로 죽는다. 예제 안 <link>·<script src> 가 실제 태그로\n파싱되어 404 도 4건 발생.\n\n- 데이터 영역의 </script> 1개, <!-- 4개를 역슬래시로 이스케이프 (<\\/script>, <\\!--)\n  — <!-- 는 script data escaped 상태로 밀어 넣어 <script 와 조합 시 같은 사고를 만든다\n- tools/export.mjs 에 가드 추가: 데이터 영역에 이스케이프되지 않은 시퀀스가 있으면\n  생성 자체를 실패시킨다 (가드 동작 확인 완료)\n- 실제 브라우저(Chrome, Playwright)로 렌더 검증: article 163 · figure.snippet 114 ·\n  꼬리질문 342 · 레퍼런스 링크 329 · 콘솔 에러 0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012XMa27Gyj5hrtYd6dk5CRt","tree":{"sha":"2b2930a8ef61eede1fb00cb052e97771702d5474","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/trees/2b2930a8ef61eede1fb00cb052e97771702d5474"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/commits/075121741f42e352b4a69cfef797645bbea70149","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26461008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan","id":26461008,"login":"David-Myeonghan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDYxMDA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commit/075121741f42e352b4a69cfef797645bbea70149","node_id":"C_kwDOUc2DYtoAKDA3NTEyMTc0MWY0MmUzNTJiNGE2OWNmZWY3OTc2NDViYmVhNzAxNDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commit/78ec9376edfdaeba55a2556f2e40835970b21c52","sha":"78ec9376edfdaeba55a2556f2e40835970b21c52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commits/78ec9376edfdaeba55a2556f2e40835970b21c52"}],"sha":"075121741f42e352b4a69cfef797645bbea70149","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commits/075121741f42e352b4a69cfef797645bbea70149"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26461008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan","id":26461008,"login":"David-Myeonghan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDYxMDA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commits/78ec9376edfdaeba55a2556f2e40835970b21c52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T15:21:05Z","email":"myeonghan12@gmail.com","name":"David Myeonghan Ryu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T15:21:05Z","email":"myeonghan12@gmail.com","name":"David Myeonghan Ryu"},"message":"feat: 코드로 답해야 하는 72문항에 코드 예제 114개 추가\n\n- 라이브 코딩 15문항 전부: debounce/throttle(취소·마지막 호출 보장), 이벤트 위임,\n  자동완성(AbortController+캐시+combobox 마크업), 무한 스크롤(IntersectionObserver+커서),\n  모달(dialog.showModal+포커스 복귀), 캐러셀(scroll-snap CSS+인덱스 동기화),\n  폼 검증(ValidityState 분기), retry(백오프+지터)/pLimit, 윈도잉(+content-visibility 대안),\n  드래그 정렬(포인터 캡처+낙관적 롤백+Alt 방향키), 탭(roving tabindex),\n  스토어(useSyncExternalStore), 라우터(pushState+포커스/제목/live region),\n  이미지 lazy(네이티브 우선), 테이블 정렬(Intl.Collator+aria-sort)\n- JS/React/TS 23문항: 이벤트 루프 출력 순서, this 유실, 복사 손실, allSettled,\n  에러 소실 4경로, WeakMap, ?? vs ||, reduce O(n²), 인덱스 key, 이펙트 취소,\n  Context 분리, StrictMode 멱등, 렌더 중 컴포넌트 정의, 제어/비제어, falsy 0,\n  unknown 좁히기, satisfies, branded 타입, zod 경계 파싱\n- CSS/성능/네트워크/보안 20문항: border-box·마진 병합, 쌓임 맥락, sticky 3원인,\n  중앙정렬·dvh, 다크 토큰 3상태, @layer, visually-hidden, 단위,\n  캐시 헤더, preflight 응답, XSS 싱크/sanitizer, postMessage 검증,\n  LCP preload+attribution, srcset, font-display, useTransition+INP attribution,\n  청크 업로드, 서비스워커 전략, Suspense 경계, PKCE+Web Locks\n- 디버깅/리뷰/AI/설계 14문항: performance.mark, layout thrashing, 응답 경합,\n  의존성 diff 훅, CLS attribution, 리뷰 수정 diff 4종, 틀린 코드 5결함+테스트,\n  커서 페이징 계약, SSE 프레임 배치, 멱등 키 결제, 기능 탐지, 배포본 확인 명령\n- 코드에 쓰인 API 마다 공식 문서 레퍼런스 보강 → 고유 레퍼런스 199 → 218개, 전부 HTTP 200\n- js 스니펫 52개 파서 통과 검증. 데이터 추출 마커를 /* DATA_END */ 센티넬로 교체\n  (코드 예제 안의 `const state = {` 문자열과 충돌하던 문제)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012XMa27Gyj5hrtYd6dk5CRt","tree":{"sha":"82dac7c8ae6f4d1cbb428183f706eac94eb5be19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/trees/82dac7c8ae6f4d1cbb428183f706eac94eb5be19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/commits/78ec9376edfdaeba55a2556f2e40835970b21c52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26461008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan","id":26461008,"login":"David-Myeonghan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDYxMDA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commit/78ec9376edfdaeba55a2556f2e40835970b21c52","node_id":"C_kwDOUc2DYtoAKDc4ZWM5Mzc2ZWRmZGFlYmE1NWEyNTU2ZjJlNDA4MzU5NzBiMjFjNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commit/36d6c10f1602288abd861a6dc17a0f53a6aaf028","sha":"36d6c10f1602288abd861a6dc17a0f53a6aaf028","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commits/36d6c10f1602288abd861a6dc17a0f53a6aaf028"}],"sha":"78ec9376edfdaeba55a2556f2e40835970b21c52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commits/78ec9376edfdaeba55a2556f2e40835970b21c52"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26461008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan","id":26461008,"login":"David-Myeonghan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDYxMDA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commits/36d6c10f1602288abd861a6dc17a0f53a6aaf028/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:18:45Z","email":"myeonghan12@gmail.com","name":"David Myeonghan Ryu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:18:45Z","email":"myeonghan12@gmail.com","name":"David Myeonghan Ryu"},"message":"feat: 면접 형식별 문항 47개 추가 — 라이브 코딩·시스템 디자인·디버깅·리뷰·과제·AI (116 → 163)\n\n웹 검색으로 2026 채용 시장의 라운드 구성을 교차 확인해 6개 영역 신설.\n문항마다 모범 답안 핵심 · 좋은/약한 신호 · 꼬리질문 + 기대 답 · 공식 문서 레퍼런스.\n\n- 라이브 코딩 15: debounce/throttle, 이벤트 위임, 자동완성(combobox+취소+캐시),\n  무한 스크롤(IntersectionObserver+커서), 모달(dialog/inert), 캐러셀(scroll snap),\n  폼 검증(ValidityState), retry/pLimit(AbortSignal), 가상 스크롤, 드래그 정렬,\n  탭(roving tabindex), 외부 스토어(useSyncExternalStore), 라우터(History API),\n  이미지 lazy, 데이터 테이블(Intl.Collator)\n- 시스템 디자인 11: RADIO 진행법, 뉴스 피드, AI 채팅 스트리밍, 자동완성 서비스,\n  협업 편집기, 대용량 업로더, 대시보드, 결제 플로우, 컴포넌트 라이브러리,\n  오프라인 노트앱, 다국어 사이트\n- 디버깅 라운드 7: 프리즈(Long Task), 빈 목록(200인데 실패), 무한 리렌더,\n  메모리 증가, 브라우저별 결함, 배포 후만 재현, 레이아웃 이동\n- 코드 리뷰 라운드 5: 리뷰 순서, dangerouslySetInnerHTML, useEffect N+1,\n  div onClick, as any\n- 과제·포트폴리오 5 / AI 도구 활용 4 (위임 기준·검증 절차·틀린 코드 찾기·팀 도입)\n\n레퍼런스 199개 전부 HTTP 200 확인 (ARIA APG·MDN·web.dev·react.dev·TS 핸드북·\nOWASP·Chrome DevTools·TanStack Query·Testing Library·MSW 등)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012XMa27Gyj5hrtYd6dk5CRt","tree":{"sha":"21c6711880ee68b99d362e39be9f9f06ba15af74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/trees/21c6711880ee68b99d362e39be9f9f06ba15af74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/commits/36d6c10f1602288abd861a6dc17a0f53a6aaf028","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26461008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan","id":26461008,"login":"David-Myeonghan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDYxMDA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-M