"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T05:50:26Z","email":"myeonghan12@gmail.com","name":"David Myeonghan Ryu"},"message":"feat: 면접관이 파고드는 꼬리질문 245단계 추가 (문항 116개 전부)\n\n- 문항마다 꼬리질문 2~3단계 + 단계별 기대 답. 기존 `후속` 한 줄은 1단계로 흡수\n- 데이터는 PROBES 맵으로 두고 런타임에 Q 에 붙임 (문항 객체 116개를 손대지 않음)\n- 레벨별 꼬리 단계: 주니어 64 · 미들 84 · 시니어 91 · 공통 6\n- 페이지는 단계 번호 있는 사슬로 렌더, 검색 대상에 꼬리질문 포함\n- README/questions.json 에도 꼬리질문 반영 (export.mjs)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012XMa27Gyj5hrtYd6dk5CRt","tree":{"sha":"ddbb11d6304130d77da635461e412d98d4839a65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/trees/ddbb11d6304130d77da635461e412d98d4839a65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/commits/bc51fd68750d1219252c631bf8be3e3a6e37d91c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26461008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan","id":26461008,"login":"David-Myeonghan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDYxMDA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan","user_view