,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T04:01:23Z","email":"myeonghan12@gmail.com","name":"David Myeonghan Ryu"},"message":"docs: 출처 성격을 정확히 표기 — 출제 이력 기록이 아님\n\n- 기존 문구 \"실제 질문 목록을 교차 확인\"은 출처 성격을 실제보다 세게 말한 표현이라 정정\n- 문항은 공개 정리글에서 반복 등장하는 주제 기준으로 선정, 문항 문장·답·판별 기준은 직접 작성\n- 참고 글 중 면접 회고 1건만 1차 자료임을 명시, 나머지는 큐레이션 글\n- 각 문항 레퍼런스는 답 내용의 공식 문서 검증용이며 출제 근거가 아님을 명시\n- 주제 선정에 쓴 한국어 정리글 3건 출처 목록에 추가\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012XMa27Gyj5hrtYd6dk5CRt","tree":{"sha":"01566c11d7308d2c850d6424d6160cdea4d8d8ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/trees/01566c11d7308d2c850d6424d6160cdea4d8d8ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/commits/e2a9abbe527d772ce23b8ae012eb7eadf6343b76","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26461008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan","id":26461008,"login":"David-Myeonghan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDYxMDA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commit/e2a9abbe527d772ce23b8ae012eb7eadf6343b76","node_id":"C_kwDOUc2DYtoAKGUyYTlhYmJlNTI3ZDc3MmNlMjNiOGFlMDEyZWI3ZWFkZjYzNDNiNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commit/cc73b4c80a6cbe4f9e8f2fb4c7099d98faef7988","sha":"cc73b4c80a6cbe4f9e8f2fb4c7099d98faef7988","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commits/cc73b4c80a6cbe4f9e8f2fb4c7099d98faef7988"}],"sha":"e2a9abbe527d772ce23b8ae012eb7eadf6343b76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commits/e2a9abbe527d772ce23b8ae012eb7eadf6343b76"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26461008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan","id":26461008,"login":"David-Myeonghan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDYxMDA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/commits/cc73b4c80a6cbe4f9e8f2fb4c7099d98faef7988/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T02:50:35Z","email":"myeonghan12@gmail.com","name":"David Myeonghan Ryu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T02:50:35Z","email":"myeonghan12@gmail.com","name":"David Myeonghan Ryu"},"message":"feat: 주니어 20문항·시니어 20문항 추가 (76 → 116)\n\n주니어(12→32): 원시/참조 타입, null vs undefined, ?. 와 ??, map/filter/reduce,\npreventDefault vs stopPropagation, URL 입력부터 화면까지, GET vs POST, HTTP 상태코드,\n쿠키/localStorage/sessionStorage, 명시도, display, CSS 단위, props vs state,\n가상 DOM, 제어/비제어 입력, 조건부 렌더링의 0 함정, alt, 시맨틱 HTML,\ndependencies/lockfile, SPA 첫 로딩\n\n시니어(21→41): 렌더링 전략 선택, 마이크로 프론트엔드, Strangler Fig, ADR,\n디자인 시스템 운영, i18n 설계, 장애 롤백·사후분석, 코드 소유권·온보딩,\nPKCE 인증 흐름, postMessage origin 검증, INP 구간 분해, 대용량 업로드,\nHTTP/2·3 번들 전략, 서비스워커 함정, 동시 편집 충돌, 동시성 렌더링,\n브라우저 지원 정책, 기능 플래그 운영, 접근성 조직 정착, 릴리스 게이트\n\n레퍼런스 162개 전부 HTTP 200 확인\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012XMa27Gyj5hrtYd6dk5CRt","tree":{"sha":"191d573174308f43033f8f1270c1933f0a1f5adc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/trees/191d573174308f43033f8f1270c1933f0a1f5adc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/David-Myeonghan/frontend-interview-kit/git/commits/cc73b4c80a6cbe4f9e8f2fb4c7099d98faef7988","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26461008?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/David-Myeonghan","id":26461008,"login":"David-Myeonghan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDYxMDA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-Myeonghan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/David-M