api.github.com/users/quanphung1120/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quanphung1120/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quanphung1120","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WDP-FA26/WDP-Web/commits/b2ebfa99d010fe34f45d3d51e99c2c0a34e458d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T19:43:47Z","email":"phungthequan030@gmail.com","name":"Quan Phung"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T19:43:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: centralize shared versions and cut redundant config (#1)\n\nConfiguration cleanup across the monorepo, verified with lint, check-types,\nbuild, Prettier, and a frozen-lockfile install.\n\n- Add a pnpm catalog for the versions shared across packages (react,\n  react-dom, next, swr, typescript, eslint, @types/*). They were copied by\n  hand into five manifests with nothing keeping them equal. Resolution is\n  unchanged.\n- Drop dependsOn edges on lint and check-types. Neither task consumes another\n  package''s output, so the edges only serialized independent work; the task\n  graph now runs in ~2.7s instead of ~4.4s.\n- Key the CI turbo cache on the commit SHA. actions/cache never overwrites an\n  existing key, so a lockfile-derived key saved once and then went stale,\n  leaving later runs effectively cold.\n- Scope the commitlint CI job''s install to the workspace root; it was\n  installing every app''s toolchain to lint one commit message.\n- Derive pnpm from packageManager and Node from a new .nvmrc instead of\n  pinning both in the workflow, and correct engines.node to Next 16''s real\n  floor of 20.9.0.\n- Remove tsconfig flags that restate tsc defaults (incremental) or describe\n  emit that never happens (declaration, declarationMap).\n- Rename the root package from the create-turbo placeholder.\n- Fix CLAUDE.md claims that did not match the configs: the @repo/ui exports\n  map target, and routes being single-sourced when basePath restates them.","tree":{"sha":"9a468cfd5fdc17b69caeae621b50066ea01dedce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WDP-FA26/WDP-Web/git/trees/9a468cfd5fdc17b69caeae621b50066ea01dedce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WDP-FA26/WDP-Web/git/commits/b2ebfa99d010fe34f45d3d51e99c2c0a34e458d1","verification":{"payload":"tree 9a468cfd5fdc17b69caeae621b50066ea01dedce\nparent 055a1d2b1fb4e339715fee69cf4f0f55b337a8c6\nauthor Quan Phung <phungthequan030@gmail.com> 1789933427 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789933427 +0700\n\nchore: centralize shared versions and cut redundant config (#1)\n\nConfiguration cleanup across the monorepo, verified with lint, check-types,\nbuild, Prettier, and a frozen-lockfile install.\n\n- Add a pnpm catalog for the versions shared across packages (react,\n  react-dom, next, swr, typescript, eslint, @types/*). They were copied by\n  hand into five manifests with nothing keeping them equal. Resolution is\n  unchanged.\n- Drop dependsOn edges on lint and check-types. Neither task consumes another\n  package''s output, so the edges only serialized independent work; the task\n  graph now runs in ~2.7s instead of ~4.4s.\n- Key the CI turbo cache on the commit SHA. actions/cache never overwrites an\n  existing key, so a lockfile-derived key saved once and then went stale,\n  leaving later runs effectively cold.\n- Scope the commitlint CI job''s install to the workspace root; it was\n  installing every app''s toolchain to lint one commit message.\n- Derive pnpm from packageManager and Node from a new .nvmrc instead of\n  pinning both in the workflow, and correct engines.node to Next 16''s real\n  floor of 20.9.0.\n- Remove tsconfig flags that restate tsc defaults (incremental) or describe\n  emit that never happens (declaration, declarationMap).\n- Rename the root package from the create-turbo placeholder.\n- Fix CLAUDE.md claims that did not match the configs: the @repo/ui exports\n  map target, and routes being single-sourced when basePath restates them.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsDdzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhbkQAGFL3RNBcj4QJNXfdvhb5T3z\nw7Sze3uA+SjxgtEu+Tf/RIWqdIUR9u/gUF69NWXWZJDJvvcNuEoVtjhJS2zoGIVF\nUPW3dVDWh459+Gr0PtS6AyGtHq8wwmi8nc5SbCuozbjMj98rItZxn87kGuQQzZAo\n5fSnd0hYUePmouwhzHItFKpCanHQbHSra/RWE/jUYN2oKGg8wPHAHW4RWdr+C7rf\n+aLjKnXMAT9l2RsT3GMrFINDadtoF20hL9wtZyacTTbk0S1HACPYNmN8n1fJBQwJ\n1VfsYdwk5ISQeHLrO741N/2LZrn8rJvMc8Ub26BxxqTxxGt8gQG+/t4fSERuDXIo\nBRA49hrTPJBZ4sH01g/blTj1MIihvmq7L19LLtDdnJNgUTJV7MycMHBcKYRaLP2v\nkaEMnGBox93Q58npBVzrjtg4EZcdzykOXrnApivpt0yWhfIZQAe+fEIcWtZMkFfW\nX46pRXPwP2ecif73J3wFMSBFefwHUcnOF07Lbq+rWMyNCrJ/u14rtxZy7+/5dYqJ\nVtOfxP7rFmcwx4bv3tFXmJYErKyzR8FcHBqKOg9tnLwrKQ/+mRbCZLDoZGtVo/ZH\naAqW93CeQ1MMOnXRVUYlXZp8Nrsq5bVo539lFwdoGdXd29bgpaLP7SGKzLdayHc8\n8CERDPBIL/cTOOahsjqi\n=STO2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-20T19:43:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WDP-FA26/WDP-Web/commit/b2ebfa99d010fe34f45d3d51e99c2c0a34e458