om/users/dulguun0225/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulguun0225/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulguun0225/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulguun0225","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dulguun0225/java-backend-template/commits/206c834ca329b0c0b1b6afa66aa5ea6a438e7108/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T05:58:56Z","email":"dulguun0225@gmail.com","name":"Dulguun Otgon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T05:58:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: repo shape is one service plus one micro-frontend (#4)\n\nThe Java service moves under backend/; frontend/ is created, not started,\nwith its decisions recorded (separate static deploy, mechanism undecided\nuntil a shell exists, backend/openapi/v1.json as the contract). CI splits\ninto backend and frontend jobs, both required on main; the frontend job\nstates that nothing gates the frontend while it is empty and demands a\nlockfile-exact install plus a check script once package.json appears.\n\nCo-authored-by: Hefesto Bot <dulguun.o@netgroup.mn>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"481a0a845461710c25668517c05fcc650f81c8f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dulguun0225/java-backend-template/git/trees/481a0a845461710c25668517c05fcc650f81c8f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dulguun0225/java-backend-template/git/commits/206c834ca329b0c0b1b6afa66aa5ea6a438e7108","verification":{"payload":"tree 481a0a845461710c25668517c05fcc650f81c8f2\nparent 1d73ccb50f40b40626f42ef78e144413f30ceeee\nauthor Dulguun Otgon <dulguun0225@gmail.com> 1789538336 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789538336 +0000\n\nfeat: repo shape is one service plus one micro-frontend (#4)\n\nThe Java service moves under backend/; frontend/ is created, not started,\nwith its decisions recorded (separate static deploy, mechanism undecided\nuntil a shell exists, backend/openapi/v1.json as the contract). CI splits\ninto backend and frontend jobs, both required on main; the frontend job\nstates that nothing gates the frontend while it is empty and demands a\nlockfile-exact install plus a check script once package.json appears.\n\nCo-authored-by: Hefesto Bot <dulguun.o@netgroup.mn>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqjAgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4GYQADl8cT64ySsXfwwdVubXdgaJ\nv1vaN56OSu4L5LZNy7I071sZFok3s2vopbF+ICxCYGC+/jyl9ndXOD5yJwAvgr6Z\nJXbJR3gNhT9DDpYqFQ/p1scYGFbAxUTb4rCz+4VuJdsbpC7HtI3cXH6AdhusJ0/L\n4Nyw5gotaMR6q9TJmTF1hzBGHUUf7C4wufCirvFkSDOe8qqbohcWWg/KIF5yuA7E\nfs02YXEUebGy3GhmwI7KHtUc8VzZe/pkol7d/s99tHenuo5MiWEDyv+vMZyRCJJI\nbSxzpdULEaeCr7n7MTz0qsGlmZNaVSKmUPis/qm2TUriJZ3GjXNs2ILXFzUCjISF\nOjpTXK7ja5rH1GXsflyQDPlKH7ylgtPnVaUykHhr6PqRNmfJogzM5FOFLacKBBhE\nuDi4MuQYiJ7XXF7pYJ65ycAhxHQJsezZw5dD6ffdPooaUzJaYDk6qH6OWtTQnCXo\nZUqtprYiLoRGaCMvqLVqsS+Bg61eDuI6z69K8UM9l7QffAKqUK/IOu9SKM4o7MKK\nkXD19RFL7J8TtAs855ADTh7W4HfBDJtkQeWz9xbK3JftGyYbv8tOM7mleJxAQDVq\nPa9YBcfPXmKXIJWhBE1M2YP/+8TXwXsteAu1qMANcSO6yCtsyJNAUi2gkk3+Xojf\ndVGs1bx6nspC5Rfbz4kn\n=tcOw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T05:58:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dulguun0225/java-backend-template/commit/206c834ca329b0c0b1b6afa66aa5ea6a438e7108","node_id":"C_kwDOUc9DO9oAKDIwNmM4MzRjYTMyOWIwYzBiMWI2YWZhNjZhYTVlYTZhNDM4ZTcxMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dulguun0225/java-backend-template/commit/1d73ccb50f40b40626f42ef78e144413f30ceeee","sha":"1d73ccb50f40b40626f42ef78e144413f30ceeee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dulguun0225/java-backend-template/commits/1d73ccb50f40b40626f42ef78e144413f30ceeee"}],"sha":"206c834ca329b0c0b1b6afa66aa5ea6a438e7108","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dulguun0225/java-backend-template/commits/206c834ca329b0c0b1b6afa66aa5ea6a438e7108"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4142584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulguun0225/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulguun0225/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulguun0225/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulguun0225/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dulguun0225","id":4142584,"login":"dulguun0225","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNDI1ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulguun0225/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulguun0225/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulguun0225/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulguun0225/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulguun0225/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulguun0225","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dulguun0225/java-backend-template/commits/1d73ccb50f40b40626f42ef78e144413f30ceeee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T05:49:21Z","email":"dulguun0225@gmail.com","name":"Dulguun Otgon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T05:49:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: one Maven module instead of a two-module reactor (#3)\n\nThe platform tier and the deployable become packages of one module. The\ncodegen runner moves to codegen/ and is launched in the java launcher''s\nsource-file mode at generate-sources on the test classpath, so\n`mvn -Pcodegen generate-sources` regenerates the jOOQ tree before anything\ncompiles; the split''s one real reason is gone. LayeringArchTest holds the\nplatform edge. init.sh renames the artifact, the OpenAPI title, the\napplication name and the sibling test packages; tested on a scratch copy.\n\nCo-authored-by: Hefesto Bot <dulguun.o@netgroup.mn>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"82bcecba2a7c609a36fd5de6ae8522f229730630","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dulguun0225/java-backend-template/git/trees/82bcecba2a7c609a36fd5de6ae8522f229730630"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dulguun0225/java-backend-template/git/commits/1d73ccb50f40b40626f42ef78e144413f30ceeee","verification":{"payload":"tree 82bcecba2a7c609a36fd5de6ae8522f229730630\nparent 1d46d0b52054043689d54d6bb4787dbf7609734d\nauthor Dulguun Otgon <dulguun0225@gmail.com> 1789537761 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789537761 +0000\n\nrefactor: one Maven module instead of a two-module reactor (#3)\n\nThe platform tier and the deployable become packages of one module. The\ncodegen runner moves to codegen/ and is launched in the java launcher''s\nsource-file mode at generate-sources on the test classpath, so\n`mvn -Pcodegen generate-sources` regenerates the jOOQ tree before anything\ncompiles; the split''s one real reason is gone. LayeringArchTest holds the\nplatform edge. init.sh renames the artifact,